e 0-3\"-telling.","tree":{"sha":"eb09f0730749a56ab8bf2f989934b5132448ada6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/eb09f0730749a56ab8bf2f989934b5132448ada6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/45dea4801ee9fe5cc8f8fee63f72ddb51d45b77f","verification":{"payload":"tree eb09f0730749a56ab8bf2f989934b5132448ada6\nparent 628226835befb6848b3daa6792e786aee6dd3bc1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784656665 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784656665 +0000\n\nOnderdeel 8/9 review-fix: payment-healthcheck-boundary, type-terminologie, cbt-d.yml-relict\n\n- payment.yml: healthcheck-stap checkte alleen order-payment terwijl Payment\n  ook provider is voor payment-notification en consumer voor payment-external;\n  draait nu zonder --boundary (alle drie), consistent met de eerdere fix van\n  de keten-smoke-stap.\n- CBT-D/tests: \"Type 0\"/\"Type 1\" in intern/ en rest/ specs geharmoniseerd met\n  de terminologietabel in CLAUDE.md (type 1 = intern, type 2 = grens binnen\n  de tribe).\n- .github/workflows/cbt-d.yml verwijderd: overbodig geworden, handmatig-only\n  relict van vóór de per-deelsysteem workflows, met verouderde \"type 0-3\"-telling.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOP0BkBn\niwIHHyVGcKbZsQWk4zac+pNtnpJOrCaJUR6a/HvA39LeDZUwXkO4jwZd+3Hsmz+CXotPH18O0JNS\n3AA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T17:57:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url"