rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/628226835befb6848b3daa6792e786aee6dd3bc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:03:02Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:03:02Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 9: demo-transparantie\n\ndemo/run.sh voegt vier geleide, stapsgewijze demo-scenario''s toe (diff-gate,\nconsumer-stub, healthcheck, bonus-minor), elk volgens de vaste structuur\nuitgangssituatie -> breuk + diff -> gate + falen -> terugdraaien + groen, met\nenter-pauzes per stap zodat de presentator het tempo bepaalt zonder live\ntypwerk. Verpakt geen nieuw gedrag, maar drie al-bewezen mechanismen\n(onderdeel 0, 2, 6) plus een bonusdemo van een backward-compatible wijziging.\n\ndemo/grensrapport.sh genereert demo/grensrapport.md uit de rauwe\nci/healthcheck.sh- en ci/smoke.sh-output tegen een draaiende stack\n(genegeerd door git, gegenereerd artefact).\n\nAlle vier scenario''s en grensrapport.sh handmatig doorlopen tegen een echte\nDocker-stack; repo blijft na elk scenario schoon. README.md en CLAUDE.md\nbijgewerkt.","tree":{"sha":"6a136529d1a099bcf7c1418d3b4414f500863291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/6a136529d1a099bcf7c1418d3b4414f500863291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/628226835befb6848b3daa6792e786aee6dd3bc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gist