m/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/5e51c37e6d3cb621348a9265f8df2083cd161ecf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:44:49Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:44:49Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 8: pijplijnvolgorde per deelsysteem\n\nAudit (geen wijziging aan de workflows nodig): alle drie de GitHub-workflows\nvolgen de gevraagde vaste volgorde -- build -> unit -> contractverificatie\n-> docker build -> compose up -> healthcheck -> keten-smoke ->\nPlaywright-scenario''s -- al exact, incrementeel correct opgebouwd sinds\nonderdeel 0. diff-gate.yml is al een aparte job, getriggerd op\ncontracts/**-wijzigingen.\n\nDe GitLab-referentie in templates/ liep wel achter:\n\n- templates/README.md en de headercommentaren in contract-verify/,\n  healthcheck/, smoke/ noemden die scripts nog \"placeholder\", terwijl ze\n  allang functioneel zijn (onderdeel 2-7)\n- templates/.gitlab-ci.yml.example toonde alleen de vier gate-componenten,\n  zonder de tussenliggende build/unit/docker-build/compose-up-stappen --\n  nu uitgebreid tot een volledig voorbeeld van Payment''s squad-pipeline\n  (de meest complete: twee grenzen serveren, twee consumeren), 1-op-1 de\n  volgorde uit .github/workflows/payment.yml\n\nGeverifieerd: workflow-stapvolgorde opnieuw gegrept (ongewijzigd, zoals\nverwacht -- deze stap raakt alleen templates/ en CLAUDE.md), YAML-syntax\nvan het uitgebreide .gitlab-ci.yml.example gevalideerd.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab03249b1c8cf4e59469b193d2b6d72c0d879037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/ab03249b1c8cf4e59469b193d2b6d72c0d879037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/5e51c37e6d3cb621348a9265f8df2083cd161ecf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/5e51c37e6d3cb621348a9265f8df2083cd161ecf","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKDVlNTFjMzdlNmQzY2I2MjEzNDhhOTI2NWY4ZGYyMDgzY2QxNjFlY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa","sha":"f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa"}],"sha":"5e51c37e6d3cb621348a9265f8df2083cd161ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/5e51c37e6d3cb621348a9265f8df2083cd161ecf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:39:11Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:39:11Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 7: keten-smoke\n\nci/smoke.sh van placeholder naar volledig functioneel:\n\n- Eén POST /api/payments (rechtstreeks naar Payment, niet via Order) volstaat\n  voor alle drie de grenzen: Payment is de enige service die in élk\n  compose-profiel (order/payment/notification) draait, en processPayment()\n  raakt binnen die ene aanroep order-payment (providerkant),\n  payment-notification (publiceert naar RabbitMQ) én payment-external\n  (roept de externe SOAP-provider aan) -- dunner kan niet gegeven de\n  profielgrenzen uit onderdeel 0/6\n- Per grens een lichte, niet-schema-diepe assertie op dezelfde respons:\n  200+paymentId/status (order-payment), approved==true (payment-external),\n  korte poll op GET /api/notifications tot PAYMENT_APPROVED verschijnt\n  (payment-notification) -- geen contractdetails herhaald, dat deden\n  onderdeel 2-4 (JVM) en onderdeel 5 (Playwright) al\n- Geen --report-only (niet gevraagd voor dit onderdeel); --boundary <naam>\n  optioneel, default alle drie, zelfde aggregatiepatroon als\n  ci/healthcheck.sh\n\nBugfix, zelfde soort als notification.yml in onderdeel 3: payment.yml''s\nketen-smoke-stap checkte alleen --boundary order-payment, terwijl Payment\nzelf alle drie de grenzen raakt. Nu ./ci/smoke.sh zonder vlag (alle drie).\n\nGeverifieerd tegen de echte draaiende stack (./start.sh): alle grenzen en\nelke losse --boundary-waarde geven PASS; FAIL-pad bevestigd door PAYMENT_URL\ntijdelijk ongeldig te maken (exit 1, duidelijke meldingen voor alle drie).\nPlaywright-suite ongewijzigd (51 tests, alles groen), healthcheck.sh\nongewijzigd functioneel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96f71970e8d3f19a3d657d9e096ac096ccee92f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/96f71970e8d3f19a3d657d9e096ac096ccee92f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKGY5Y2ZkNDZhYWVhZjNkODJjZDMxOWUxN2EyYzMxNTE3NDA5MGJmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298","sha":"b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298"}],"sha":"f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f9cfd46aaeaf3d82cd319e17a2c315174090bffa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:30:46Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T21:30:46Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 6: deployment-healthcheck (compositiebewaking)\n\nci/healthcheck.sh van placeholder naar volledig functioneel:\n\n- Grens-graaf hardcoded (drie vaste grenzen): order-payment\n  (provider=payment, consumer=order), payment-notification\n  (provider=payment, consumer=notification), payment-external (alleen\n  consumer=payment -- geen lokale provider, \"n.v.t.\"-melding zoals\n  ci/contract-verify.sh''s payment-external-provider-tak uit onderdeel 4)\n- Leest /actuator/info bij provider en consumer, valideert major gelijk +\n  pin-minor <= served-minor; bewust geen jq, parsing met grep/sed/cut in\n  dezelfde stijl als diff-gate.sh''s major()-helper\n- --boundary <naam> beperkt tot één grens (matcht hoe de drie workflows hem\n  al aanriepen sinds onderdeel 0); zonder de vlag alle drie. --report-only\n  degradeert FAIL naar niet-blokkerend, zelfde patroon als diff-gate.sh\n- Geen wijziging nodig aan de workflows zelf -- hun bestaande\n  --boundary-aanroepen waren al correct gescopet\n\nGeverifieerd tegen de echte draaiende stack (./start.sh): alle grenzen en\nelke losse --boundary-waarde geven PASS bij de huidige 1.0.0-pins.\nDemo-scenario 3 daadwerkelijk gereproduceerd: Order''s\ncontracts.consumes.order-payment tijdelijk op 2.5.0 gezet, Payment''s\ncontracts.serves.order-payment op 2.3.0, beide containers herbouwd,\n/actuator/info bevestigde de mismatch, en de healthcheck gaf exact\n\"FAIL order-payment: pinned 2.5.0, served 2.3.0\" (exit 1 blokkerend, exit 0\nmet --report-only) -- daarna volledig teruggedraaid. Playwright-suite\nongewijzigd (51 tests, alles groen).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0fa287022c1ae786149395d0da314555f004d34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/d0fa287022c1ae786149395d0da314555f004d34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKGI3OTY1MjBjM2I0NjA1ZmQxNjIzZjYyZDc0YjU0ZjZjMmY3NjkyOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed","sha":"4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed"}],"sha":"b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b796520c3b4605fd1623f62d74b54f6c2f769298"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:57:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:57:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 5: Playwright-laag (tester-eigenaarschap)\n\n- Nieuwe herbruikbare ajv-fixture (CBT-D/tests/fixtures/ajv-schema.ts):\n  assertMatchesSchema()/getSchema() laden JSON Schema uit de gepinde\n  OpenAPI/AsyncAPI (beide delen dezelfde components.schemas.<Naam>-\n  structuur, dus één generieke helper volstaat). Een nieuw scenario\n  toevoegen vereist alleen een aanroep van deze fixture, geen aparte\n  YAML/ajv-plumbing meer per bestand\n- 6 bestanden met gedupliceerde ajv/js-yaml-boilerplate gerefactored naar\n  de fixture (order-lookup-contract, order-create-contract,\n  payment-contract, notification-contract, order-payment,\n  payment-notification-rest) — scenario-inhoud ongewijzigd\n- async/payment-notification.spec.ts valideert nu écht met ajv tegen\n  PaymentNotificationPayload (was: losse veld-asserts zonder schema-compile)\n- Twee nieuwe \"ontbrekend verplicht veld\"-scenario''s (payment-contract:\n  orderId, order-create-contract: amount) — dekken een scenario-categorie\n  die nog ontbrak (alleen amount=0/lege string was eerder getest, nooit een\n  écht ontbrekend veld)\n- Nieuwe dunne semantische ketentest (chain/order-to-notification.spec.ts +\n  vijfde Playwright-project): Order aanmaken → Payment keurt goed →\n  Notification levert een schema-conforme, opvraagbare notificatie —\n  herhaalt geen grens-specifieke scenario''s, bewijst alleen de zakelijke\n  uitkomst van de volledige keten\n- order.yml: NOTIFICATION_URL toegevoegd + chain-spec meegenomen (Order''s\n  compose-profiel bevat de volledige backend-trio)\n\nBugfix, gevonden door de nieuwe \"ontbrekend orderId\"-test: zonder verplicht\nveld faalde Jackson-deserialisatie vóór de controllerlogica, en Spring''s\ndefault foutlichaam mist het \"message\"-veld dat ErrorResponse sinds\nonderdeel 2 vereist. PaymentController krijgt een @RestControllerAdvice\n(HttpMessageNotReadableException -> 400 + conforme ErrorResponse) —\nprecies het soort defect dat contractverificatie hoort te vangen.\n\nGeverifieerd: npx playwright test --list (51 tests, 5 projecten), volledige\nlokale stack (./start.sh) met de complete suite groen (inclusief de nieuwe\ntests en de bugfix), mvn test in payment/backend (9/9, geen regressie op\nonderdeel 2-4, springdoc-drift-check nog steeds leeg).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98de3fa225f35dd0d69f511884feb329f6557eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/98de3fa225f35dd0d69f511884feb329f6557eea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKDRkYzgyMTAwM2VmZGNjM2NjZjU0YTczMzliOGM1ZDQzYzA4MDk5ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8","sha":"b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8"}],"sha":"4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/4dc821003efdcc3ccf54a7339b8c5d43c08099ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:38:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:38:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 4: SOAP-grens Payment -> extern (WSDL/XSD)\n\n- XSD vooraf geëxtraheerd uit contracts/payment-external/1.0.0/payment.wsdl\n  naar schemas/payment-external.xsd (zelfde patroon als onderdeel 3);\n  bewust ook gekopieerd naar payment/backend/src/main/resources/schemas/ —\n  Docker''s buildcontext voor dit deelsysteem kan contracts/ niet bereiken,\n  dus rechtstreeks vanuit contracts/ bundelen (eerst geprobeerd via een\n  pom.xml-resource) faalt pas zichtbaar bij een echte\n  `docker compose --profile payment up --build`, niet bij mvn test alleen.\n  Beide bestanden moeten bij een WSDL-wijziging worden bijgewerkt (zie\n  CLAUDE.md).\n- SoapClient.kt gerefactored van kale RestTemplate naar Spring-WS\n  WebServiceTemplate (SoapConfig.kt): payload-only Source/Result i.p.v.\n  handmatig gebouwde envelope, PayloadValidatingInterceptor (client-side,\n  org.springframework.ws.client.support.interceptor -- niet de\n  serverkant-variant) valideert elk uitgaand Authorize-verzoek tegen het\n  XSD. spring-ws-core:4.0.13 trekt jakarta.xml.soap-api + saaj-impl zelf\n  mee, geen handmatige SAAJ-dependency nodig (bevestigd via\n  dependency:tree vóór de rest gebouwd werd)\n- Alleen requestvalidatie: de bestaande WireMock-fixtures voor de externe\n  provider (CBT-D/wiremock/mappings/soap-authorize-*.json) sturen\n  namespace-gequalificeerde child-elementen terug die niet overeenkomen\n  met de (unqualified) WSDL-schema -- responsvalidatie zou daar altijd op\n  stuklopen. SoapClient''s eigen uitgaande payload bouwt daarom bewust\n  ongekwalificeerde kinderen onder een wel gekwalificeerd root-element,\n  exact zoals de schema voorschrijft\n- PaymentExternalContractTest.kt: in-process WireMock speelt de bestaande\n  stub-logica na (approved/rejected op orderId 999); drie gevallen\n  (approved, rejected, en een bewust niet-conform verzoek zonder ''amount''\n  dat de interceptor moet vangen)\n- ci/contract-verify.sh: nieuwe case payment-external-consumer; expliciete\n  \"n.v.t. -- buiten de tribe\"-melding voor payment-external-provider i.p.v.\n  de generieke NOT-IMPLEMENTED, want dat is hier een architecturale keuze\n- payment.yml: derde contractverificatie-stap\n- CLAUDE.md: sectie over de SoapClient-refactor, het bewust gekozen\n  request-only-validatiepad, en de gedocumenteerde XSD-duplicatie\n\nGeverifieerd: mvn test in payment/backend (9/9, geen regressie op\nonderdeel 2/3), ci/contract-verify.sh end-to-end voor alle vier\ncontracten/kanten uit de bouwprompt, een echte\n`docker compose --profile payment up --build` met handmatige curl-tests\ntegen de draaiende container (approved + rejected pad beide correct via de\ngerefactorde SoapClient), Playwright-suite ongewijzigd (47 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70b508ac39baf724536bc50b7bd4f9d8b4348b44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/70b508ac39baf724536bc50b7bd4f9d8b4348b44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKGIzMWI4ZDI3MTY4Y2YwMjdhYTJjNzExMzFkZTNjMWFlYjliYzgyYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8","sha":"c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8"}],"sha":"b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/b31b8d27168cf027aa2c71131de3c1aeb9bc82c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:56:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:56:37Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 3: async-grens Payment -> Notification (RabbitMQ)\n\n- JSON Schema vooraf geëxtraheerd uit contracts/payment-notification/1.0.0/\n  asyncapi.yaml naar schemas/payment-notification-payload.schema.json\n  (draft-07, refloos genoeg om mechanisch te doen, geen buildstap)\n- Producerkant (payment/backend): PaymentNotificationProducerContractTest\n  instantieert PaymentService rechtstreeks (Mockito voor SOAP/RabbitTemplate/\n  NotificationClient, geen Spring-context of live broker nodig), vangt het\n  gepubliceerde bericht op en valideert het met networknt json-schema-\n  validator tegen het geëxtraheerde schema (approved + rejected)\n- Consumerkant (notification/backend): NotificationConsumerContractTest\n  valideert een rauwe JSON-string tegen het schema en bewijst zowel dat een\n  conform bericht correct wordt verwerkt (NotificationService.receive ->\n  getByOrderId) als dat een bericht zonder verplicht veld (notificationId)\n  door de validator wordt gevangen\n- ci/contract-verify.sh: nieuwe tak voor --contract payment-notification,\n  beide --side-waarden; herstructureerd naar functies per contract/kant,\n  NOT-IMPLEMENTED-fallback voor onderdeel 4 blijft intact\n- Bugfix onderdeel 0: notification.yml riep --side provider aan voor\n  payment-notification, maar Notification is de consumer van die grens\n  (Payment publiceert/serveert). payment.yml kreeg de ontbrekende\n  contractverificatie-stap voor payment-notification (had alleen\n  order-payment)\n- CLAUDE.md: sectie over de async-contractverificatie-aanpak + checklist-\n  item om het geëxtraheerde schema bij een AsyncAPI-wijziging opnieuw af\n  te leiden\n\nGeverifieerd: mvn test in beide services (6/6 payment, 2/2 notification),\nci/contract-verify.sh end-to-end voor beide contracten/kanten plus\nregressiecheck op order-payment en de NOT-IMPLEMENTED-fallback,\nPlaywright-suite ongewijzigd (47 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8800c75dfa43046fed1d53a562165c4e2fdffc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/d8800c75dfa43046fed1d53a562165c4e2fdffc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8","node_id":"C_kwDOSYl2q9oAKGM5MDNhN2NhMDU2M2Q2YmRlYWZhYzU0ZDUzYWI3ZmZkOGVlNjdkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commit/f102071a5d11dda4a632db5c1fa3bb9207f8cc53","sha":"f102071a5d11dda4a632db5c1fa3bb9207f8cc53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f102071a5d11dda4a632db5c1fa3bb9207f8cc53"}],"sha":"c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/c903a7ca0563d6bdeafac54d53ab7ffd8ee67dd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f102071a5d11dda4a632db5c1fa3bb9207f8cc53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:42:08Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:42:08Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 2: REST-grens Order -> Payment, beide kanten\n\nProviderkant (payment/backend):\n- swagger-request-validator-core (niet de met Boot 3.5/Jakarta incompatibele\n  -mockmvc-adapter, zie CLAUDE.md) valideert order-payment-interacties via\n  een @SpringBootTest + TestRestTemplate, externe calls (SOAP/RabbitMQ/\n  Notification) gemockt zodat de test los van de gecomponeerde stack draait\n- springdoc genereert /v3/api-docs; PaymentController + nieuwe OpenApiConfig\n  geven het exacte contract terug (info/servers/@Operation/@ApiResponses/\n  @Schema); jaxb-api toegevoegd als glue-dependency voor een JDK21-gat in\n  swagger-core\n- ci/contract-verify.sh --side provider draait de test en vergelijkt de\n  gegenereerde spec met oasdiff tegen het gepubliceerde contract (drift-check)\n\nConsumerkant (order/backend):\n- swagger-request-validator-wiremock-junit5 (wiremock-jre8-standalone i.p.v.\n  de losse jar, om een Jetty-versieconflict met Spring Boot''s BOM te\n  omzeilen) valideert Order''s uitgaande verzoeken tegen een WireMock-stub;\n  bewijst zowel het happy path als dat een niet-conform verzoek (ontbrekend\n  orderId) wordt gevangen — het mechanisme achter demo-scenario 2\n- ci/contract-verify.sh --side consumer draait deze test\n\ncontracts/order-payment/1.0.0/openapi.yaml: drie kleine correcties zodat de\ngegenereerde en gepubliceerde spec exact overeenkomen (OAS 3.0.1-notatie,\ntags, required op ErrorResponse) — nog vóór er een echte externe consument\nvan deze versie bestaat.\n\nCLAUDE.md: nieuwe sectie met de tooling-compatibiliteitsbevindingen (research\nvia WebSearch/WebFetch/gh api, niet aangenomen) zodat onderdeel 3-4 dezelfde\nvalkuilen niet opnieuw hoeft te ontdekken.\n\nGeverifieerd: mvn test in beide services (Docker Maven-image + .m2-cache),\nci/contract-verify.sh end-to-end voor beide --side-waarden, oasdiff-drift\nleeg, Playwright-suite ongewijzigd (47 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a875de8aa852e3d5f17e2fcee12437653da43ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/a875de8aa852e3d5f17e2fcee12437653da43ac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/f102071a5d11dda4a632db5c1fa3bb9207f8cc53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"http