_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/commits/f4c59d9db360d3c47b8a76af86c6dc5d74432a13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T14:59:38Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T14:59:38Z","email":"j.sim18011963@gmail.com","name":"Johannes Sim"},"message":"Onderdeel 1: zelfverklaring per deelsysteem (/actuator/info + OCI-labels)\n\n- pom.xml (order/payment/notification): contracts.serves.*/contracts.consumes.*\n  properties als enige bron van waarheid, plus gedeeld resources-filtering-blok\n  (@-delimiters, om Spring''s ${...}-placeholders niet te verstoren)\n- application.yml: info.contracts.serves/consumes gevuld via resource filtering;\n  management.info.env.enabled=true (staat sinds Boot 2.5 standaard uit)\n- Dockerfile (3x): gedeeld ARG/LABEL-blok, waarden via --build-arg\n- ci/lib/pins.sh (nieuw): leest contracts.*-properties uit een pom.xml\n- ci/docker-build.sh (nieuw): gedeeld build-script, geeft pins door als\n  --build-arg; vervangt de kale \"docker build\"-stap in de drie workflows\n- README.md: Zelfverklaring-sectie\n\nGeverifieerd per service via een echte docker build + docker run: OCI-labels\nen /actuator/info tonen exact dezelfde serves/consumes-waarden.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4b825fe020acf42fb4bc26fc2dc3f71c3d6995c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/c4b825fe020acf42fb4bc26fc2dc3f71c3d6995c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/f4c59d9db360d3c47b8a76af86c6dc5d74432a13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https