(CLAUDE.md-conventie)\n- Contracten gemigreerd naar versie-directories contracts/<naam>/1.0.0/...\n- ci/diff-gate.sh functioneel (oasdiff via tufin/oasdiff Docker-image), bewijst\n  demo-scenario 1 end-to-end; contract-verify.sh/healthcheck.sh/smoke.sh als\n  placeholders met uniform PASS/FAIL-formaat (ci/lib/gate-output.sh)\n- GitHub Actions herbouwd tot squad-pipelines per deelsysteem (order/payment/\n  notification.yml) met vaste stapvolgorde, plus diff-gate.yml op contracts/**\n- Docker Compose-profielen (local/order/payment/notification) in\n  CBT-D/docker-compose.yml; start.sh/sts.sh/stop.sh gebruiken --profile local\n- GitLab CI/CD-componenten in templates/ als niet-draaiende referentie\n- CLAUDE.md/README.md/CBT-D/README.md bijgewerkt, incl. expliciete vastlegging\n  van de CI-architectuurbeslissing als afwijking van claude-code.prompt.md\n- claude-code-prompt.md -> claude-code.prompt.md (bestandsnaam-mismatch met\n  CLAUDE.md-verwijzing gefixt)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9ababd192efba68ff7fecda33c55d5b1f3c62b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/trees/e9ababd192efba68ff7fecda33c55d5b1f3c62b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sim007/My-Showcase-CBT/git/commits/a378350219118f4d7ec4f993c79ee8c068989e1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7187405?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sim007","id":7187405,"login":"Sim007","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODc0MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sim007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u