t body required''\n\n* fix: add logout button to user menu\n\nFixes #612 - No logout button in dashboard UI\n\nAdd logout button to the user menu (avatar dropdown) in NavRail''s\nContextSwitcher. Calls POST /api/auth/logout then redirects to /login.","tree":{"sha":"fe57ddec7b49dc74fcdfe0ac6c37b15a405d9b40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WYJade/Agent-123/git/trees/fe57ddec7b49dc74fcdfe0ac6c37b15a405d9b40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WYJade/Agent-123/git/commits/53745fd13e5d7609828ca4b3e47c4cf7595f7990","verification":{"payload":"tree fe57ddec7b49dc74fcdfe0ac6c37b15a405d9b40\nparent 82d8891067b448615cabfa93175374510b783d67\nauthor nmsn <136696700@qq.com> 1778127145 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127145 +0700\n\nfix: add logout button to user menu (#632)\n\n* fix: send user id in DELETE request body\n\nFixes #614 - Delete user from UI fails with ''Request body required''\n\n* fix: add logout button to user menu\n\nFixes #612 - No logout button in dashboard UI\n\nAdd logout button to the user menu (avatar dropdown) in NavRail''s\nContextSwitcher. Calls POST /api/auth/logout then redirects to /login.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BEpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPvEQAAY6xRlbiHzMayJIYfos4+aS\n9H/rdcG5sR0Mar3/vLm56xj+KwVeter87fUYCpWvOENXb2+Up1Sh02rM/XS9Leny\nGqL000S9hDypKH5DyT/mjA8c8RSUsaAnCoRJo4og4QMwjCMhdrWS+d5OKmKCxHxG\ncDQbcG1GRRQerYCzatocu+YgbvT5W8zDXuxdP7qt+ZS1YxE0oq0EEba9ihnnxenS\neD5FWhOiEwKdj0SKMn8sk8uXASzGQc9CHqNe+vgF+A9khwXZRIPuYKuVIU+O4TMp\n8yYWauwC3GYvZ2rIO7oJ0XeZMMC1pvNbs18vvX+iy32ekkLbuIYuc+j55vK+Jf10\nt1YPqKOTCpnlYHWBIW0tRwITqc1DmFBgP9p14TpQCb7bU2NjbtSEVz6xJcaUEIsD\nCWIke0kaQU0aI6JE+tC/MDoiz4CI6LOzKb1Ct6CKvjzaarBD1AmkBdfIDcsW1aj9\nWSZq+Ladkc/9MwNOsnIRtfqekqWlg2HXvwRT4jhnx/3mZ65tjP6MZuybbpBaIdVs\n28GYGUsEFwNvgw4zWm5Rrhz1ebWuNPmBDMAb7viWfTb14leBt9vToNVipu9YfTd9\nNoadesNU6mGjFSyBNirzq2F3/d5wcSThqtqm2A70QfSRW6IgsGXIvENdlhE6EVo/\n8Gm0btG/p4RmLsL1ii5H\n=9gX9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","veri