Element. This commit makes the inspector forms actually respond\n  via :host-context + ancestor-descendant rules in inspector-styles.scss:\n  Compact tightens gaps + input padding, Spacious loosens them, Comfortable\n  is the default.\n- settings.page: densityCycle / densityLabels (3 presets), cycleDensity\n  rotates through; live Editor density row sits next to Theme + Accent.\n  Lifted the old fake ''editor-density'' link out of demo-settings.\n\nPersists to user_settings.editorDensity. Only the inspector responds for\nnow; node-card padding could also honor density later.","tree":{"sha":"3fc7944baf72a427d04ddbefba130c0d1fbcc248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/3fc7944baf72a427d04ddbefba130c0d1fbcc248"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/3df73d0969980a34c43d978ea7d717c295b9a477","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/3df73d0969980a34c43d978ea7d717c295b9a477","nod