 SCSS token wins). Auth-load adoptSettings now reads\n  accentColor from UserSettings and applies on launch alongside theme.\n  Per-class readonly accentValues map (Default=null + 4 OKLCH presets).\n- Renamed signal getters: theme.current -> theme.currentTheme so the\n  service can carry sibling currentAccent / currentDensity / currentRetention.\n  Updated settings.page accordingly. setTheme replaces set().\n- settings.page: accentCycle / accentLabels (5 presets), cycleAccent\n  rotates through them; live Accent row next to Theme in the Appearance\n  section. Lifted the old fake ''accent'' link out of demo-settings.\n\nPersists to user_settings.accentColor and syncs across devices via DC.","tree":{"sha":"51b3583b722804fb68bcd7d8dc0f0a721aa1a63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/51b3583b722804fb68bcd7d8dc0f0a721aa1a63f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/662d36cd17756a4715fabd5e67fbfc9555b63dac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_t