s schema extended with accentColor (default\n  ''default''), editorDensity (default ''comfortable''), retentionLimit (Int,\n  default 50). GetMySettings + UpsertMySettings now read/write all four\n  preference columns; each upsert arg stays optional so null leaves the\n  existing column untouched.\n- generated SDK regenerated (npm run dataconnect:sdk:generate).\n- libs/repositories: new AccentColor + EditorDensity enums, extended\n  UserSettings + UpsertUserSettingsInput, validator maps in the mapper\n  (Set-based; null/unknown values fall back to the documented default).\n  Repository upsert forwards all four fields.\n\nNo UI yet — the pickers + apply (CSS var override for accent, editor\nSCSS density var, Cloud Function for retention cleanup) come next, on top\nof this foundation. User must redeploy DC (firebase deploy --only dataconnect)\nor restart the local emulator so the new columns exist.","tree":{"sha":"47b9cbd8bf98f36e609e13b28a736b7e6f2466ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/47b9cbd8bf98f36e609e13b28a736b7e6f2466ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/2c9cf14ca7b0e5281d24de4ccdd1a4a23e9ec14c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/2c9cf14ca7b0e5281d24de4ccdd1a4a23e9ec14c","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDJjOWNmMTRjYTdiMGU1MjgxZDI0ZGU0Y2NkZDFhNGEyM2U5ZWMxNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897","sha":"3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897"}],"sha":"2c9cf14ca7b0e5281d24de4ccdd1a4a23e9ec14c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/2c9cf14ca7b0e5281d24de4ccdd1a4a23e9ec14c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:16:03Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T15:16:03Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: settings backed by Data Connect (UserSettings table)\n\n- data-connect/schema: new UserSettings type, 1:1 with User keyed by userId\n  (own table, not columns on User — keeps the auth/identity row minimal and\n  lets settings evolve independently). themePreference is the first field;\n  accent / density / retention will land alongside it.\n- connector: GetMySettings query (returns null until first set, clients fall\n  back to defaults), UpsertMySettings mutation (creates on first call,\n  updates after). DeleteMyAccount comment updated to note the new cascade.\n- generated SDK regenerated via npm run dataconnect:sdk:generate.\n- libs/repositories: UserSettings model + utils (string->ThemePreference\n  validation defaulting to System) + UserSettingsRepository (get / upsert).\n- CapacitorTheme: dropped Capacitor Preferences in favour of the repo.\n  Subscribes to AuthService.currentUser; on auth (sign-in or restore),\n  fetches the user''s settings and applies. set() upserts to the backend.\n  catchError keeps the outer subscription alive across transient fetch\n  failures. App starts in System theme until auth resolves (brief FOUC).\n- app.config: eager-injects CapacitorTheme so the auth subscription is\n  active from launch; removed the old .load().subscribe() call.\n\nUser must redeploy DC (firebase deploy --only dataconnect) or restart the\nlocal emulator so the new user_settings table exists before signing in.","tree":{"sha":"8470c5236c23449e1c7c5824b7bdb7c2134cd73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/8470c5236c23449e1c7c5824b7bdb7c2134cd73b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDNjNjMzNWZlMmRjMDNhZmYyYTNkOWFkOWExNGUwZWQ0YWY3OGI4OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/e8772a63f94ca228bbe6d59b7b3625a1332090d6","sha":"e8772a63f94ca228bbe6d59b7b3625a1332090d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/e8772a63f94ca228bbe6d59b7b3625a1332090d6"}],"sha":"3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3c6335fe2dc03aff2a3d9ad9a14e0ed4af78b897"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/e8772a63f94ca228bbe6d59b7b3625a1332090d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:52:09Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:52:09Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: detect device timezone for new time triggers + settings row\n\n- apps/remote-editor/new-node.utils: createNewNode for Time nodes now uses\n  Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone (with UTC fallback) so a\n  user dropping a Time trigger on the canvas gets their own timezone, not\n  a hardcoded ''UTC''\n- apps/remote-settings/demo-settings: Time zone row reads the same detected\n  value (was hardcoded ''Europe/Kyiv''), drops the chevron since it isn''t\n  user-editable in this MVP, detail text explains the source\n\nTiny commit but the only one of the ''small prefs'' rows with a real downstream\neffect; the rest (accent / density / language / retention) are pure cosmetic\nor need backing infrastructure (retention needs a cleanup job, language\nneeds Angular i18n).","tree":{"sha":"8fd193208f82642cadeeafe0002633bae428144b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/8fd193208f82642cadeeafe0002633bae428144b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/e8772a63f94ca228bbe6d59b7b3625a1332090d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v