ara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/a3c194aee0db49f0e2e4e210b8f71a2e558df552/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:37:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:37:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: export-as-JSON action in settings (GDPR data portability)\n\n- export-data.model: ExportData = {exportedAt, user, flows, executions}\n- export-data.utils: pure buildExportData() aggregator,\n  serializeExportData() (JSON.stringify with 2-space indent),\n  exportFilename() (notifly-export-YYYY-MM-DD.json)\n- settings.page: exportData() forkJoins user + listMine + listRecent then\n  fetches each template''s full graph via getGraph, drops null graphs, builds\n  the ExportData and triggers a browser download via Blob + anchor[download].\n  Lifts the Export row out of demo-settings into a live ''Data'' section.\n- Web tested; native (Capacitor WebView) may or may not honor the download\n  attribute — if it fails on Android we''ll add @capacitor/filesystem +\n  @capacitor/share as a follow-up.","tree":{"sha":"856159b7648687aebec6946db097381cf24115f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/856159b7648687aebec6946db097381cf24115f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/a3c194aee0db49f0e2e4e210b8f71a2e558df552","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,