"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/4df30276e95e963aa568c71539704b8032c232ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:25:31Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:25:31Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: theme dark-mode toggle (system / light / dark)\n\n- libs/theme: new ThemePreference enum (System / Light / Dark) alongside the\n  existing ThemeMode (the applied light/dark used by tokens). Preference is\n  what the user picks; Mode is what''s painted.\n- libs/capacitor: CapacitorTheme service persists the preference via Capacitor\n  Preferences (key ''theme-preference''), applies it by toggling .ion-palette-dark\n  on document.documentElement, listens to prefers-color-scheme so System mode\n  follows the OS in real time. Storage key + palette class are private readonly\n  members; no over-extracted util for the trivial enum-membership check.\n- eslint: type:data-access may now depend on type:theme (theme is pure\n  tokens/enums; no UI). Mirrors what type:ui/type:feature already allow.\n- shell appInitializer: loads the persisted theme on app start so the first\n  paint matches the user''s last choice.\n- settings.page: removes the static ''Theme'' link from demo-settings; renders\n  a live Appearance row backed by theme.current(); tap cycles\n  System -> Light -> Dark -> System with the new label shown inline.","tree":{"sha":"22bbff7f6c05d789bdcf8173db2f2b1af7c4b6f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/22bbff7f6c05d789bdcf8173db2f2b1af7c4b6f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/4df30276e95e963aa568c71539704b8032c232ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/4df30276e95e963aa568c71539704b8032c232ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDRkZjMwMjc2ZTk1ZTk2M2FhNTY4YzcxNTM5NzA0YjgwMzJjMjMyYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e","sha":"012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e"}],"sha":"4df30276e95e963aa568c71539704b8032c232ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/4df30276e95e963aa568c71539704b8032c232ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:06:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T14:06:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: edge deletion + drag-position persistence\n\n- flow-editor: (click) on SVG edge path emits (edgeDeleted) with the edge id;\n  hover thickens the stroke + cursor pointer so the hit target reads as\n  interactive. clientToWorld helper now returns the existing Point type\n  instead of an inline {x,y}.\n- flow-editor: new public currentPositions(): ReadonlyMap<string, Point>\n  reads the live engine.boxes() so the page can persist node positions\n  after the user drags them around.\n- editor.page: onEdgeDeleted filters the edge out of the writable loaded\n  graph. save() reads currentPositions() via viewChild(FlowEditorComponent)\n  and merges them into each node''s positionX/positionY before replaceGraph;\n  the saved graph now reflects the canvas layout after drag.\n\nCloses the two known small editor gaps. Next: P2 settings completion\n(theme, export, delete-account, prefs).","tree":{"sha":"00af2c8fc83284130a021ee30bb3fb01621f2f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/00af2c8fc83284130a021ee30bb3fb01621f2f68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDAxMmU5NWNiZDljZjAzMTMwZWE2NjJlZjk3ZTIwMjgxNmY5Y2MyOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597","sha":"68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597"}],"sha":"012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/012e95cbd9cf03130ea662ef97e202816f9cc28e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:09:22Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:09:22Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: E5 — ''Use my location'' button in geo inspector\n\n- GeoInspectorComponent: dashed button beneath the lng input emits\n  (requestLocation); component stays free of platform deps (flow-editor is\n  buildable, can''t reach LOCATION_PORT in flow-runtime)\n- editor.page: injects LOCATION_PORT optional; onRequestLocation calls\n  currentPosition() via the port, merges {latitude, longitude} into the\n  selected node''s region while preserving its name and other fields. The\n  port''s adapter (CapacitorLocation) already wraps the transistorsoft\n  getCurrentPosition + ensures location permission, so the system prompt\n  appears automatically on first use\n\nMap picker (Leaflet/Mapbox) intentionally deferred — numeric lat/lng inputs\nplus ''use my location'' cover the MVP geofence flow.","tree":{"sha":"91a2e4c9372b8e0e75808e438d6eb90d7420e19b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/91a2e4c9372b8e0e75808e438d6eb90d7420e19b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDY4ZGYwODhkY2EyYWE4NWY1OWI0ZDUwZWM4NDBmMzllZWE3ZTk1OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/c6d63695366f0ed2cd87b5f9c9fcd5427e2de852","sha":"c6d63695366f0ed2cd87b5f9c9fcd5427e2de852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/c6d63695366f0ed2cd87b5f9c9fcd5427e2de852"}],"sha":"68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/68df088dca2aa85f59b4d50ec840f39eea7e9597"},{"author":{"avat