 the non-buildable\n  repositories lib). Per-type default config matches the inspector fallbacks\n  (Time 9:00 daily UTC, geo 150m enter, battery <=20%, calendar 10min lead,\n  wait 1min, if equals-empty).\n- editor.page: paletteOpen signal + togglePalette/closePalette; onAddNode\n  appends the new node to the writable loaded graph and selects it;\n  onDeleteNode removes the node + every incident edge, clears selection if\n  the deleted node was selected. + button in topbar, delete button in\n  inspector sidebar.\n\nEdges still aren''t user-drawable (E4) and dragged-node positions still aren''t\npersisted (deferred). Geofence map picker is E5.","tree":{"sha":"0980dfb66f874b0da39c674ce3c9e721d9465ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/0980dfb66f874b0da39c674ce3c9e721d9465ce8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/3f540bc5300df687437f6127b3ed05315daf4a5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/