/out of region,\n  battery level+charging, calendar event-within-leadtime); guardHolds dispatch\n- runtime.service: gathers sensor snapshot before processing (only sensors used\n  by All inputs; calendar window = max lead time), aborted runs skip history\n- capacitor: CapacitorDeviceState (@capacitor/device), CapacitorLocation\n  (transistorsoft getCurrentPosition), CapacitorCalendarAdapter\n  (@ebarooni/capacitor-calendar, read-only, degrades to [] on failure)\n- editor: BatteryParams/CalendarParams structured, battery/calendar format utils","tree":{"sha":"db18b4e833e8288123e58fc977a5ce2e41415e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/db18b4e833e8288123e58fc977a5ce2e41415e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/6e578f39586732f1cd0c0ac9e8ef2a4b9e53c3b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/6e578f39586732f1cd0c0ac9e8ef2a4b9e53c3b2","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDZlNTc4ZjM5N