qlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/4aba457cc1ac16d0c9340053ea474aa8170d7292","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDRhYmE0NTdjYzFhYzE2ZDBjOTM0MDA1M2VhNDc0YWE4MTcwZDcyOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/33bade4fe586194abc565ae3f247569e971bc09c","sha":"33bade4fe586194abc565ae3f247569e971bc09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/33bade4fe586194abc565ae3f247569e971bc09c"}],"sha":"4aba457cc1ac16d0c9340053ea474aa8170d7292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/4aba457cc1ac16d0c9340053ea474aa8170d7292"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/33bade4fe586194abc565ae3f247569e971bc09c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:35:13Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:35:13Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: F2 Home — flows list wired to listMine\n\napps/remote-flows — the Home screen. Header (wordmark) + \"Your flows\" title\n+ active/paused stats + flow-card list + FAB + bottom tab bar, composing the\nlibs/ui primitives (Wordmark, FlowCard, TabBar, Icon).\n\n- Data: ProcessTemplateRepository.listMine() via toSignal over a reload-trigger\n  signal (switchMap). undefined = loading, [] = empty, [...] = list.\n- Toggle on a card → setEnabled(id, value), then bumps the reload trigger to\n  refetch. Empty-subscribe + tap + takeUntilDestroyed.\n- Empty state (the norm right now — no flows exist yet): icon + copy +\n  \"Browse templates\" → /templates.\n- FAB → /editor; tab bar → flows/templates/history/settings.\n- Tokens throughout (--text-*, --radius-*); FAB shadow literal (no shadow\n  token yet).\n\nDeferred (need data that doesn''t exist yet): mini-flow node chips + last/next\nrun labels (need graph + execution data — F3/F4), \"runs this week\" stat,\nfilter chips (All/Active/trigger-type), header search/more. FlowCard renders\nwithout the mini-flow until the list query carries node types.","tree":{"sha":"ca86f4866972c24f6b72cd58208988005df0eaa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/ca86f4866972c24f6b72cd58208988005df0eaa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/33bade4fe586194abc565ae3f247569e971bc09c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url"