l":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/feed2c83b87f630754760d29c9d89a2b4b43c00c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:21:15Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:21:15Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: workspace-local lint rule banning formControlName/formGroup/ngSubmit\n\ntools/lint/no-template-form-directives.mjs — custom @angular-eslint template\nrule. Flags formControlName / formGroup / formGroupName attributes and\n(ngSubmit) events in HTML templates, steering toward [formControl]=\n\"form.controls.x\" binding + button-click submission (per the reactive-forms\n+ semantic-elements conventions).\n\nWired as the ''nf'' plugin in the root eslint.config.mjs **/*.html block.\nPlaced in tools/lint/ (not tools/eslint-rules/, which Nx reserves for its\nown workspace-rules machinery + expects a tsconfig there).\n\nVerified: fires on formControlName (''Avoid formControlName...''), passes on\n[formControl]. All 13 projects lint green.","tree":{"sha":"9d4b590bd76f54b7082644c7d2261174de349c5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/9d4b590bd76f54b7082644c7d2261174de349c5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/feed2c83b87f630754760d29c9d89a2b4b43c00c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/feed2c83b87f630754760d29c9d89a2b4b43c00c","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKGZlZWQyYzgzYjg3ZjYzMDc1NDc2MGQyOWM5ZDg5YTJiNGI0M2MwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27","sha":"b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27"}],"sha":"feed2c83b87f630754760d29c9d89a2b4b43c00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/feed2c83b87f630754760d29c9d89a2b4b43c00c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:31:01Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:31:01Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: F1 onboarding — combined intro + auth screen\n\napps/remote-onboarding — the first real feature slice. Single screen\n(wordmark + value-prop hero + email/password + Google), wired end-to-end\nthrough L2 auth + L1 repositories.\n\n- Create-first auth heuristic: try signUpWithEmail; on email-already-in-use,\n  fall back to signInWithEmail (catchError, not try/catch). On success →\n  upsertCurrentUser → navigate to /flows.\n- Reactive form: FormGroup model, bound via [formControl]=\"form.controls.x\"\n  (not formControlName); submit via button click + form-level keyup.enter\n  (no ngSubmit) per the semantic-elements rule.\n- Empty-subscribe pattern: switchMap/tap/catchError/finalize in the pipe,\n  bare .subscribe(), takeUntilDestroyed for teardown.\n\nlibs/auth additions:\n- auth-error.utils: AUTH_ERROR_MESSAGES record keyed by Firebase''s own\n  AuthErrorCodes constants (no magic strings; i18n-ready), authErrorCode,\n  authErrorMessage, isEmailAlreadyInUseError.\n- AuthErrorPipe ({{ error | authError }}) for template display.\n- AuthService: sign-out/reset/delete now return Observable (defer-wrapped)\n  instead of Promise — promises converted to Observables at the lowest\n  level so higher layers stay rxjs-only.\n\nDeferred (TODO): cloneDefault starter-flow on first signup needs default\ntemplates seeded; not wired yet. Google sign-in uses popup (web); mobile\nneeds the Capacitor auth plugin.","tree":{"sha":"536b6ae53640201c9ef6660b40cc415cd0000ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/536b6ae53640201c9ef6660b40cc415cd0000ca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKGI1YjFkYzQyYzc2NGFhMTFmNmZiOTU5MDc5OWI1YjY4MWQ3Y2NiMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628","sha":"3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628"}],"sha":"b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/b5b1dc42c764aa11f6fb9590799b5b681d7ccb27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:30:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:30:46Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: radius + type tokens, rxjs-x lint rules\n\nlibs/theme — extend the token set beyond colors/fonts:\n- Radius scale: --radius-xs/sm/md/lg/xl/2xl/pill (6/9/12/14/18/22/999),\n  consolidated from the prototype''s inline values.\n- Type scale: --text-micro/meta/caption/body/name/heading/screen-title\n  (exact prototype px, half-px preserved — no rounding, per design-precision).\n  Recurring sizes only; one-off display sizes stay literal.\n\nlibs/ui — primitives now consume the tokens instead of hardcoded values\n(chip/toggle/live-dot/wordmark pill, node-badge xs, flow-card xl; chip/\nflow-card/tab-bar font sizes via --text-*).\n\neslint — rxjs-x plugin (0.9.x, eslint-9 compatible) on **/src/**/*.ts with\nprojectService typed linting:\n- rxjs-x/no-subscribe-handlers — enforces the empty-subscribe convention\n  (side effects go in tap/catchError/finalize, never in subscribe handlers).\n- rxjs-x/no-unsafe-takeuntil — takeUntil-style operators must be last.\nScoped to src/ so root config files (capacitor.config.ts etc.) that aren''t\nin a tsconfig don''t trip projectService.","tree":{"sha":"3fdcb699a37c0f21787c5af87c796ca304e3c7ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/3fdcb699a37c0f21787c5af87c796ca304e3c7ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDMxNDBjMzZiOWZmNzNiNzY3NDFiODQxOWRjMDg3YTRmM2UxNzc2Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72","sha":"ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72"}],"sha":"3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/3140c36b9ff73b76741b8419dc087a4f3e177628"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T08:04:20Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T08:04:20Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"refactor: data-connect to workspace root + generated SDK as @notifly/data-connect-sdk\n\nTwo structural moves requested by the user:\n\n1. Backend infra to root. data-connect/, firebase.json, .firebaserc moved\n   from apps/shell/ to the workspace root — it''s backend, not shell-specific.\n   capacitor.config.ts stays in apps/shell (genuinely app-specific). firebase\n   CLI scopes file access to the firebase.json directory, so the schema had\n   to move with the config. npm scripts + tools/dataconnect-codegen.mjs no\n   longer cd into apps/shell.\n\n2. Generated SDK out of the domain lib. The Data Connect SDK was buried in\n   libs/repositories/src/lib/generated/ — but it''s a vendored, tool-produced\n   artifact (own package.json, esm/, angular/), not hand-written source. Moved\n   to data-connect/generated/ (co-located with the schema that produces it),\n   exposed as the @notifly/data-connect-sdk tsconfig path. connector.yaml\n   outputDir: ../generated, package: @notifly/data-connect-sdk. repositories\n   now imports from @notifly/data-connect-sdk instead of ./generated.\n\nConsequence: libs/repositories is no longer ng-packagr-buildable. Once the\ngenerated SDK lives outside the lib''s src, ng-packagr would leave the import\nunresolved in an isolated dist. We never publish these libs (apps + remotes\ncompile lib source via tsconfig paths), so the build target was only an\nisolated-compile check. Dropped it; kept lint + test. data-connect-client\nstays buildable (it doesn''t touch the generated SDK).\n\nVerification: nx run-many -t lint,build green across all 13 projects; shell\nbuild-web resolves @notifly/data-connect-sdk through the path mapping. Live\ndeploy unaffected (same serviceId/instance — config files just relocated).","tree":{"sha":"4450df79544c6da3627912c2f11871c91a2a6ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/4450df79544c6da3627912c2f11871c91a2a6ddb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKGFlMWE0MjI3MWM5YzA4OTU0YWQ5ODMzM2Q2ZmVjMjIxZDAxOTBmNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e","sha":"5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e"}],"sha":"ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/ae1a42271c9c08954ad98333d6fec221d0190f72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:18:43Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:18:43Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: L4 UI primitives — libs/ui ported from prototype\n\nCross-app visual primitives, pixel-ported from ../product_design/\n(primitives.jsx + screens-home.jsx). All standalone, OnPush, signal\ninputs/outputs. Consume @notifly/theme OKLCH tokens; no hardcoded colors.\n\nAtoms:\n- nf-icon: 33-icon inline-SVG set (IconName enum + ICON_PATHS), stroke/size/\n  color inputs. Paths copied verbatim from the prototype dictionary.\n- nf-wordmark: \"noti[dot]flow\" with the accent node-dot for the i.\n- nf-live-dot: pulsing accent dot with soft ring.\n- nf-chip: 5 tones (neutral/accent/primary/warn/rose) via ChipTone enum.\n- nf-toggle: iOS-style switch — semantic <button role=switch aria-checked>,\n  emits toggled.\n\nComposites:\n- nf-node-badge: colored category square (outline | filled via NodeBadgeVariant)\n  keyed by ProcessNodeType. PROCESS_NODE_VISUALS maps type → NodeKind + icon;\n  color pulled from @notifly/theme NODE_TOKENS.\n- nf-mini-flow: the node chain shown on flow cards.\n- nf-tab-bar: bottom nav, RouterLink + routerLinkActive driven, items as input\n  (no hardcoded routes — the app supplies them).\n- nf-flow-card: home-screen card — name, description, enabled toggle, mini-flow,\n  last/next run labels. Emits toggled.\n\nProcessNodeType enum + PROCESS_NODE_VISUALS live in libs/ui for now (UI''s visual\ncatalog). If L6/L7 need a canonical domain node-type enum, lift to a shared util\nlib then.\n\nlibs/ui package.json: peer deps @angular/core, @angular/router, @notifly/theme.\n\nAll 13 projects lint + build clean.","tree":{"sha":"2598ceac7b746a13fb513a67a687fe44916fd811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/2598ceac7b746a13fb513a67a687fe44916fd811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDUyNTc1OTNlODljOTI2MjM3NDgyM2E5YWRlMTg1YjQwZThmY2VhNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/6de0e98f8ffd9a3e0abb05141c0a7c1d50941cab","sha":"6de0e98f8ffd9a3e0abb05141c0a7c1d50941cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/6de0e98f8ffd9a3e0abb05141c0a7c1d50941cab"}],"sha":"5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/5257593e89c9262374823a9ade185b40e8fcea5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/6de0e98f8ffd9a3e0abb05141c0a7c1d50941cab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T19:52:05Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T19:52:05Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: L2 auth wrapper — libs/auth + shell wiring\n\nlibs/auth (scope:shared, type:data-access) — Firebase Auth wrapper\n- AuthService: reactive currentUser / isInitialized / isSignedIn signals\n  populated by onAuthStateChanged. Sign-in / sign-up methods return\n  Observable<AuthenticatedUser>; sign-out / reset / delete return Promise.\n- AuthenticatedUser model: uid + email + displayName + SignInProvider\n  enum (Password | Google) + isEmailVerified. Mapped from FirebaseUser via\n  utils/auth-user.utils.ts.\n- authRequired CanActivateFn: waits for isInitialized to flip, then either\n  allows navigation or redirects to /onboarding. Applied to every remote\n  route except onboarding itself in apps/shell/src/app/app.routes.ts.\n- provideAuth() returns an EnvironmentInitializer that eagerly injects\n  AuthService so the onAuthStateChanged listener starts at app boot,\n  independent of which route lands first.\n\nFirebase init ownership: provideRepositories owns initializeApp +\ngetAuth + getDataConnect. AuthService just calls getAuth() to grab the\nexisting singleton. Order in apps/shell/src/app/app.config.ts is\nprovideRepositories first, provideAuth second.\n\napps/shell wiring\n- app.config.ts: provideRepositories({ firebaseConfig }) + provideAuth().\n  Emulator branch dropped (we''re on live Cloud SQL now; add back via a\n  separate environment.dev.ts if local emulator dev becomes desirable).\n- environment{,.mobile}.ts: dropped the useDataConnectEmulator flag.\n- app.routes.ts: authRequired guard on flows / editor / history /\n  templates / settings. /onboarding is public.\n\nDecisions deferred to F1 onboarding:\n- F1 will call usersRepository.upsertCurrentUser(...) after signup so the\n  User row exists. AuthService does NOT auto-upsert (keeps L2 decoupled\n  from L1''s repositories).\n- F1 will call processTemplateRepository.cloneDefault(''sunday-mood-check'')\n  to seed the new user''s account with a starter flow.\n\nPRD divergence (continues from L1):\n- Anonymous auth is NOT wired here per project_auth_providers.md\n  (FR-5 \"Could\" dropped from MVP).","tree":{"sha":"a797aba8b38a3d6854c5a5e8fd53314e972f0a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/a797aba8b38a3d6854c5a5e8fd53314e972f0a9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/6de0e98f8ffd9a3e0abb05141c0a7c1d50941cab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gis