r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/bf24acba9aae81350e23ea2f1d8fd283cc0e07e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T19:25:07Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T19:25:07Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: L1 user-gate — live Firebase config + security tightening\n\nUser-gate complete:\n- Firebase project provisioned (notifly-web-app), us-central1.\n- Cloud SQL db-f1-micro (instance: notifly-db, db: notifly) being created.\n- Email/Password + Google auth providers enabled (Anonymous dropped per\n  project_auth_providers.md).\n- npm run dataconnect:deploy succeeded.\n\nLive config in apps/shell/src/environments/environment{,.mobile}.ts (firebase\nblock — public web SDK keys, security via @auth rules per Firebase model).\n\nSecurity: dropped $uid client-supplied parameter from GetCurrentUser,\nUpsertCurrentUser, UpdateMyProfile, DeleteMyAccount. uid now sourced from\nauth context via id_expr: \"auth.uid\". Resolves the four INSECURE warnings\nthat Firebase flagged on first deploy — a logged-in user can no longer\nread/write another user''s row.","tree":{"sha":"abd0586da78b3746368c66063786dcf63fd5ae42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/abd0586da78b3746368c66063786dcf63fd5ae42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/bf24acba9aae81350e23ea2f1d8fd283cc0e07e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/bf24acba9aae81350e23ea2f1d8fd283cc0e07e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKGJmMjRhY2JhOWFhZTgxMzUwZTIzZWEyZjFkOGZkMjgzY2MwZTA3ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a","sha":"7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a"}],"sha":"bf24acba9aae81350e23ea2f1d8fd283cc0e07e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/bf24acba9aae81350e23ea2f1d8fd283cc0e07e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:44:13Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:44:13Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: L1 data layer — Data Connect schema + repositories\n\nPersistence foundation per L1 sub-plan. Schema deviates from PRD v1.2 $12.1:\nTemplate entity collapsed into ProcessTemplate via isDefault flag (will be\ndocumented in PRD v1.3 amendment). Code-level vocabulary is BPMN-style;\nuser-facing copy stays \"Flow\".\n\napps/shell/data-connect/\n- schema.gql: User, ProcessTemplate, ProcessNode, ProcessEdge, ProcessExecution.\n  ProcessTemplate.isDefault distinguishes app-provided defaults from user-owned.\n  Row-level @auth blocks removed (Data Connect rejects them at schema level);\n  ownership enforced in the connector via where clauses + ownerId_expr.\n- queries.gql: GetCurrentUser, ListMyProcessTemplates, ListDefaultProcessTemplates,\n  GetProcessTemplateGraph, ListRecentProcessExecutions, ListProcessExecutionsForTemplate\n- mutations.gql: UpsertCurrentUser, UpdateMyProfile, DeleteMyAccount,\n  CreateProcessTemplate, UpdateProcessTemplateHeader, ClearProcessTemplateGraph,\n  InsertProcessNode, InsertProcessEdge, SetProcessTemplateEnabled,\n  DeleteProcessTemplate, AppendProcessExecution.\n  Graph save split into composable parts because the SDK generator doesn''t\n  yet support custom _Data array inputs.\n\napps/shell/firebase.json + .firebaserc\n- Co-located with capacitor.config.ts under apps/shell (firebase CLI scopes\n  file access to firebase.json''s directory; deeper nesting hit \"outside of\n  project directory\" guard).\n- Emulator config: auth :9099, dataconnect :9399, UI :4000.\n\nlibs/data-connect-client (scope:shared, type:data-access)\n- Generic Firebase Data Connect infra. DataConnectClient service wraps the\n  generated SDK''s mutation/query promises into rxjs Observables, normalising\n  errors via toDataConnectError().\n- DATA_CONNECT_INSTANCE InjectionToken — populated by provideRepositories().\n- Schema-agnostic. Knows nothing about the NotiFly domain.\n\nlibs/repositories (scope:shared, type:data-access)\n- Domain layer. Owns the schema-coupled generated SDK in src/lib/generated/\n  (committed; regenerated automatically by the build via the generate-sdk\n  target that depends on data-connect/**/*.gql).\n- Domain models: ProcessTemplate, ProcessTemplateGraph, ProcessNode,\n  ProcessEdge, ProcessExecution, User. Locale, ProcessNodeKind,\n  ProcessExecutionStatus modelled as string enums.\n- Repositories: UsersRepository, ProcessTemplateRepository,\n  ProcessExecutionRepository. Each injects DataConnectClient, maps\n  generated GraphQL types into domain types via per-topic utils/.\n- provideRepositories(config) — bootstrap helper. Calls initializeApp +\n  getAuth + getDataConnect with the generated connectorConfig, optionally\n  connects to emulators.\n\nlibs/theme\n- NODE_KINDS, NODE_TOKENS, THEME_MODES converted to TS string enums per\n  the project''s enum preference.\n\ntools/dataconnect-codegen.mjs\n- Wraps `firebase dataconnect:sdk:generate` so the npm script stays stable\n  even if firebase-tools CLI flags drift.\n\nVerification\n- All 12 projects lint + build clean.\n- Firebase emulator boots with the schema (postgres started, schema validated).\n- Schema deploy to live Cloud SQL deferred to user-gate ($10/mo decision).\n- Round-trip Jest spec omitted per user decision to leave unit tests out\n  of MVP scope; manual emulator verification is the L1 sign-off bar.\n\nNext: user-gate — create Firebase project, provision Cloud SQL db-f1-micro\nin us-central1, hand back firebaseConfig, then `npm run dataconnect:deploy`.","tree":{"sha":"5e6f82cfd18ef9a20b6aa7d7b633aa631a2b88f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/5e6f82cfd18ef9a20b6aa7d7b633aa631a2b88f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a","node_id":"C_kwDOSYt439oAKDcyMzA0MDJiYzhjNmExMmNhZmVhZjE4NmE2MDBmNWNhMmRlYzc5OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara/notifly/commit/be6a64c6c1abd2dd1687ff91eea6d44f54a06e77","sha":"be6a64c6c1abd2dd1687ff91eea6d44f54a06e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/be6a64c6c1abd2dd1687ff91eea6d44f54a06e77"}],"sha":"7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/7230402bc8c6a12cafeaf186a600f5ca2dec798a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/be6a64c6c1abd2dd1687ff91eea6d44f54a06e77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T18:42:35Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T18:42:35Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"chore: add npm scripts for dev, build, mobile composition, and Capacitor\n\nExposes the common operations as standard package-manager scripts so\ncontributors don''t need to memorise nx + capacitor invocations.\n\nHighlights:\n  npm start                 nx run-many -t serve --parallel=10 (shell + 6 remotes)\n  npm run start:shell       just nx serve shell\n  npm run build             production web build (shell:build-web)\n  npm run build:mobile      tools/compose-mobile.mjs --prod (composed Capacitor bundle)\n  npm run build:mobile:dev  same, dev configuration\n  npm run lint / lint:fix   nx run-many -t lint\n  npm run cap:sync          `cd apps/shell && cap sync` (after build:mobile)\n  npm run ca