ubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/224035f4ddb95e1c1f244524b0837ff2e840a3b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:55:22Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:55:22Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"refactor: single shell + page-as-remote module federation\n\nReplaces apps/mobile + apps/web with one shell app and 6 page remotes.\nThe shell composes them differently per build target:\n\n  shell:build-web    -> dynamic federation host (manifest fetched at runtime)\n  shell:build-mobile -> static composition (relative-path manifest, remotes\n                        copied into shell-mobile/<name>/ for the Capacitor\n                        WebView)\n\napps/shell - single Ionic + Capacitor shell\n- IonApp + IonRouterOutlet root, two build targets sharing src/\n- environments/environment.{ts,mobile.ts} swapped via fileReplacements; mobile\n  target reads federation.manifest.mobile.json with relative URLs\n- Web manifest lists dev URLs 4201-4206; mobile manifest lists ./<name>/\n- capacitor.config.ts targets dist/apps/shell-mobile/browser\n\napps/remote-{onboarding,flows,editor,history,templates,settings}\n- Each generated via @nx/angular:application + native-federation:init\n- Exposes ./Routes from src/app/page.routes.ts -> lazy-loaded Ionic placeholder\n- Standalone-bootable bootstrap.ts for nx serve <remote> dev workflow\n- Tagged scope:remote, type:app\n\ntools/compose-mobile.mjs\n- Builds shell-mobile + 6 remotes sequentially (parallel federation builds\n  raced and dropped remoteEntry.json for some remotes)\n- Verifies each remoteEntry.json present before copying\n- Copies dist/apps/<remote>/browser -> dist/apps/shell-mobile/browser/<remote>/\n\neslint.config.mjs\n- New scope taxonomy: scope:shell|remote|shared (was mobile|web|shared).\n  Shell may consume remotes + shared; remotes may consume shared only.\n\nVerification (all green)\n- nx run-many -t lint                -> 10/10 pass\n- nx run shell:build-web             -> 170 kB initial, dynamic host\n- nx run shell:build-mobile          -> 170 kB initial, static manifest baked\n- node tools/compose-mobile.mjs      -> 6 remotes composed into shell-mobile/\n- Static HTTP serve of mobile bundle -> all routes 200 including\n  /remote-<name>/remoteEntry.json + main.js for all 6 remotes","tree":{"sha":"e662cc1049e64e091160bae20d06500b8e66d479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/e662cc1049e64e091160bae20d06500b8e66d479"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/224035f4ddb95e1c1f244524b0837ff2e840a3b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists