c51f7beb4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/24fb0bcf522fcac7ac9259f4596ffcc51f7beb4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fujivara","id":136718996,"login":"fujivara","node_id":"U_kgDOCCYqlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/a39829d04eced287798bed50c4cef9e6d4f5c4fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:14:17Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:14:17Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"feat: Phase 2 — federation, theme, ESLint baseline, .claude rules\n\nlibs/theme — design tokens\n- Verbatim port of ../product_design/styles.css OKLCH layer to\n  libs/theme/src/lib/_tokens.scss. Light + dark via :root.ion-palette-dark.\n- Ionic CSS-var bridge (libs/theme/src/lib/_ionic-bridge.scss) maps OKLCH\n  onto --ion-color-primary/success/warning/danger so stock Ionic components\n  inherit the brand without per-component restyling.\n- libs/theme/src/index.ts exports NODE_KINDS / NODE_TOKENS as `as const`\n  + `satisfies` per common/typescript/advanced-type-safety.md.\n- apps/mobile and apps/web both @use the theme global from src/styles.scss.\n\nlibs/ui, libs/flow-editor — shells generated for Phase 3+ population.\n\napps/web — Native Federation host\n- @angular-architects/native-federation v21 init schematic. Web is now a\n  dynamic-host: federation.manifest.json + initFederation() in main.ts.\n- Stub manifest; remotes added per-feature in Phase 3+.\n\nESLint baseline\n- @nx/enforce-module-boundaries with our taxonomy: scope:mobile|web|shared,\n  type:app|feature|ui|data-access|util|theme.\n- Cross-scope dependencies blocked. Lower type tiers cannot import higher.\n- @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any, no-unused-vars (with _ ignore),\n  consistent-type-imports (separate-type-imports).\n- All 5 projects build + lint clean.\n\n.claude/rules/ — adapted to NotiFly\n- design-tokens.md rewritten for libs/theme (was tm-mirror).\n- design-precision.md examples reference NotiFly prototype + FlowCard.\n- tailwind-usage.md DELETED (no Tailwind in this stack).\n- ionic-scss-usage.md NEW. Two-layer theming, :host discipline, logical\n  properties, libs/ui vs component SCSS guidance.\n- workspace-structure.md NEW. apps/libs layout, federation pattern\n  (mobile static / web dynamic), tag taxonomy + boundary rules.\n\n.claude/settings.local.json — pruned tm-mirror paths, generic patterns only.\n\napps/web cleanup — removed nx-welcome and stale spec.","tree":{"sha":"47961d5da16685243b944a3daed4faf87f4d275f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/47961d5da16685243b944a3daed4faf87f4d275f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/a39829d04eced287798bed50c4cef9e6d4f5c4fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136718996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/followers","following_url":"https: