ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fujivara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/commits/5c4ef1d124cc2ac2507bfdccb4698fe67607be36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T18:40:50Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T18:40:50Z","email":"marat.skyba@gmail.com","name":"Marat Skyba"},"message":"chore: initial Nx 22 workspace with Angular 21 + Ionic 8\n\nPhase 1 scaffold for the NotiFlow bachelor thesis project.\n\nWorkspace\n- Nx 22.7 with classic (non-project-references) TS config so @nx/angular\n  generators work; the modern reference-based setup isn''t compatible with\n  Angular yet.\n- npm package manager, prettier formatter, jest unit runner, ESLint config\n  per app, no e2e runner wired yet.\n\napps/mobile (Capacitor host)\n- Angular 21 standalone, esbuild bundler, prefix nf\n- Ionic 8 wired via provideIonicAngular (mode: ios)\n- IonApp + IonRouterOutlet root, lazy-loaded HomePage placeholder\n- Capacitor 8 core + iOS/Android/App/Haptics/Keyboard/StatusBar plugins\n- capacitor.config.ts targets dist/apps/mobile/browser\n\napps/web\n- Angular 21 standalone shell. Empty for now; runtime federation host\n  comes in Phase 2.\n\nCarry-overs from prior session\n- .claude/rules/ and .claude/skills/ retained as-is. Several project-tier\n  rules still reference tm-mirror paths and will be rewritten in Phase 2.\n- CLAUDE.md merges the project''s coding philosophy with the Nx-scaffolded\n  agent instructions.","tree":{"sha":"c36b55e604aa6bac95aaa77454148ce8dc8deb1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/trees/c36b55e604aa6bac95aaa77454148ce8dc8deb1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fujivara/notifly/git/commits/5c4ef1d124cc2ac2507bfdccb4698fe67607be36","verification"