ance:'' label for natural\nimperative closers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41e3102964e17b82e160de96928f2da04569aedf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/41e3102964e17b82e160de96928f2da04569aedf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/2c84a7114913a2e50d7ad7afda03b3a7fb0c95aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/2c84a7114913a2e50d7ad7afda03b3a7fb0c95aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKDJjODRhNzExNDkxM2EyZTUwZDdhZDdhZmRhMDNiM2E3ZmIwYzk1YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837","sha":"3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837"}],"sha":"2c84a7114913a2e50d7ad7afda03b3a7fb0c95aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/2c84a7114913a2e50d7ad7afda03b3a7fb0c95aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:20:31Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:20:31Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"feat(game): wire dsa_patterns + book into study order; extractor union-scan + wiring guard\n\n- extract.py: union ALL interview-matching sections per file (recovers\n  lld/anti_patterns'' shadowed §12), additive moduleCounts in index.json,\n  new check_wiring guard (--strict fails CI on STUDY_ORDER gaps or\n  STUDY_PATHS subset violations); pages.yml runs --strict\n- app.js: STUDY_ORDER.book (13 DDIA chapters, pinned order),\n  cs_fundamentals/dsa_patterns in STUDY_ORDER + interview path (290 Qs),\n  capturableModules() filters zero-question reader-only dirs out of the\n  Codex grid/denominator (426->402), quest pools, and cartographer/foil_row\n  awards (previously unobtainable for lld/book)\n- content: spring_websocket_stomp 18 inline Q&As split to canonical form;\n  lld/pattern_comparisons InterviewQuestions.md reformatted to canonical\n  heading + bold-Q (50 Q&As now extract; ids safe - never extracted before)\n- graph/*.json now gitignored (CI regenerates; drift-proof), docs synced\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c77f04404926592de846ee881cfe906c1a7de6d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/c77f04404926592de846ee881cfe906c1a7de6d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKDNmMTdkOWQ3NjYxZjdjZjA5YTFjMTZlNmI0NzVlNzVkMTc3NTU4Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4","sha":"f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4"}],"sha":"3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/3f17d9d7661f7cf09a1c16e6b475e75d17755837"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:19:35Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:19:35Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"fix(devops): correct off-hours savings math in finops module\n\nQ16 answer dropped an unsupported ''narrower window'' claim (12h weekday\nschedule saves ~64%, not 76%; ~76% needs an 8h on-hours window), and the\npre-existing schedule comment''s arithmetic now matches its own example.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"311cec8fe7749d4a7e13a0833eaf93d1bad3c72d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/311cec8fe7749d4a7e13a0833eaf93d1bad3c72d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKGY4ODlhYzc0YjlkZDJhNDAyNWZjNzMyYzQyODU3YmY3YmQxNGVkZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/7c7396b56ad96b1b43aaa8b42d00a3a14aff8ad5","sha":"7c7396b56ad96b1b43aaa8b42d00a3a14aff8ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/7c7396b56ad96b1b43aaa8b42d00a3a14aff8ad5"}],"sha":"f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/f889ac74b9dd2a4025fc732c42857bf7bd14edd4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/7c7396b56ad96b1b43aaa8b42d00a3a14aff8ad5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:07:03Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:07:03Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"content(backend): backfill interview Q&As to 16 in six thin modules\n\ndistributed_system_operational_patterns +9, service_mesh_and_service_discovery +9,\ncontainer_and_deployment_patterns +8, load_and_performance_testing +8,\nmessaging_patterns +8, chaos_engineering +7 — appended to §12 only\n(15-question floor compliance, Stage 3 Batch 1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com