 path, pattern matrix, interview shortcuts\n- Upgrade solid_principles/README.md: add 12 interview Q&As\n- Upgrade anti_patterns/README.md: add 10 interview Q&As\n- Update lld/README.md with Category Navigation section linking all 6 indexes\n- Update lld/CLAUDE.md with cross-references and updated adding guide\n\nHLD (2 new modules):\n- consensus_algorithms/README.md: Raft, Paxos, PBFT, ZAB, etcd/KRaft (576 lines)\n  19 Q&As, ASCII sequence diagrams, split-brain BROKEN->FIX, etcd case study\n- event_sourcing_cqrs/README.md: ES, CQRS, Saga, projections, snapshots (584 lines)\n  15 Q&As, CQRS+ES ASCII architecture, BROKEN->FIX, e-commerce case study\n- Update hld/README.md and hld/CLAUDE.md module tables\n\nPython:\n- python/fastapi/README.md: 48-line stub -> 1002-line full 14-section module\n  Preserves all 20 sub-module links; adds ASGI pipeline, DI mechanics,\n  BROKEN->FIX (sync-in-async), 15 Q&As, Gunicorn tuning, case study summary\n\nLLM (4 new modules):\n- ai_regulations_and_compliance/README.md: EU AI Act risk tiers, GDPR Art. 22,\n  NIST AI RMF, model cards, DPIA, hiring-algorithm BROKEN->FIX (1225 lines)\n- llm_ops_platforms/README.md: MLflow, W&B, LangSmith, LangFuse, Braintrust,\n  DeepEval, Ragas — experiment tracking, LLM observability, eval CI/CD (1003 lines)\n- vision_language_models/README.md: CLIP dual encoder, LLaVA two-stage training,\n  BLIP-2 Q-Former, Grounding DINO, visual grounding, VQA benchmarks (893 lines)\n- constitutional_ai/README.md: SL-CAI critique-revision, RL-CAI/RLAIF,\n  constitution design, RLAIF vs RLHF tradeoffs, legal-assistant case study (718 lines)\n- Update llm/CLAUDE.md: module count 45->49, remove all planned markers\n- Update root README.md: add all 8 new modules to HLD and LLM tables\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"733826ccb048551d82117e68c2fdf5812ea3e8cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/733826ccb048551d82117e68c2fdf5812ea3e8cf"},"url":"https