at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/e72024beafd9d907ea8a671aca4c848ed721c730","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKGU3MjAyNGJlYWZkOWQ5MDdlYThhNjcxYWNhNGM4NDhlZDcyMWM3MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043","sha":"ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043"}],"sha":"e72024beafd9d907ea8a671aca4c848ed721c730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/e72024beafd9d907ea8a671aca4c848ed721c730"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:19:39Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:19:39Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"Update CLAUDE.md and README.md: reflect LLM expansion (42 modules, 65 sub-files)\n\nUpdate module counts, sub-file lists, and new module entries for\nagentic_workflow_patterns, coding_agents, voice_agents, browser_agents_deep_dive,\nand the 30+ new sub-files across agents_and_tool_use, agentic_frameworks,\nmulti_agent_systems, and mcp_model_context_protocol.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6c37d7817efd20ace72e598ec7162fd68a44fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/b6c37d7817efd20ace72e598ec7162fd68a44fb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKGNjZjQwNmNlYjI1MTUyNGFjM2I2OGQ4Mzg3YWE1ZjMxODlkNWIwNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6","sha":"5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6"}],"sha":"ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/ccf406ceb251524ac3b68d8387aa5f3189d5b043"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:19:11Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:19:11Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"Expand LLM section to production-grade depth: 75 files, +31k lines\n\nCase studies in all 38+ LLM module READMEs expanded to 150-700L each\nwith concrete scale numbers, ASCII architecture diagrams, BROKEN→FIX patterns,\nproduction metrics tables, and 5+ interview Q&As per module.\n\n13 dedicated LLM case studies deepened to 798-1015L each:\n- design_chatgpt, design_copilot: tool integration, multi-region, capacity math\n- design_llm_gateway: proportional circuit breaker, cache poisoning fix, ROI math\n- design_rag_pipeline: type-aware chunking, embedding model compatibility guard\n- design_ai_search_engine: freshness scoring, paywall handling, crawl tier topology\n- design_ai_coding_assistant: SWE-agent test staleness guard, RLHF feedback loop\n\nNew top-level modules written from scratch:\n- browser_agents_deep_dive, voice_agents, agentic_workflow_patterns\n- coding_agents, vllm_deep_dive (with PagedAttention/prefix caching)\n- reasoning_models (o1-style test-time compute)\n\nNew sub-files across 6 topics (35 total):\n- agents_and_tool_use: reflexion, tree_of_thoughts, tool_selection_at_scale,\n  sandboxed_code_execution, subagents_and_delegation, agent_ux_patterns,\n  durable_long_running_agents, agent_cost_and_token_budget\n- agentic_frameworks: openai_agents_sdk, claude_agent_sdk, pydantic_ai,\n  smolagents, strands_aws, mastra_typescript, litellm_routing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ca460bbf583928845bf0ff99520b00fded6364a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/8ca460bbf583928845bf0ff99520b00fded6364a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKDVkYmU3ZmNmNjA3Yzg1NGEwZTUyMTkxNDQzM2M2MzM5ZTIzZDkzYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752","sha":"7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752"}],"sha":"5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/5dbe7fcf607c854a0e521914433c6339e23d93c6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:12:10Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:12:10Z","email":"rutikp@finfactor.ai","name":"rutik46"},"message":"Expand Spring and ML case studies to production depth\n\nSpring (23 modules + 5 dedicated case studies):\n- All 23 module Case Studies expanded to 125-310L each\n- 6 weakest modules (spring_aop, spring_testing, spring_transactions,\n  spring_cloud_patterns, spring_performance, spring_boot_configuration)\n  expanded with full production scenarios, BROKEN→FIX patterns, and 5+ Q&As\n- Remaining 17 modules topped off to 125L+ with targeted war stories and Q&As\n- 5 dedicated case studies deepened to 966-1075L each with failure scenarios,\n  capacity planning, multi-region considerations, and additional interview Q&As\n\nML (32 modules + 10 dedicated case studies):\n- All 32 module Case Studies expanded to 150-330L each using Python 3.10+ type hints\n- Production anchors: Netflix recommendation (two-tower, FAISS), XGBoost fraud\n  detection (SHAP, cost-matrix threshold), PSI drift monitoring, DDP/FSDP\n  distributed training, GPTQ/AWQ quantization, DDPM medical imaging, LSTM log\n  anomaly detection, SimCLR/BYOL contrastive learning\n- 10 dedicated case studies deepened to 884-1059L each with BROKEN→FIX Python,\n  capacity planning math, failure scenarios, and 5 additional interview Q&As\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f3c4066420ceafc710c9bb3d78fdb83070aab7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/trees/3f3c4066420ceafc710c9bb3d78fdb83070aab7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/git/commits/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752","node_id":"C_kwDOSY0T1NoAKDc3NzFlMzA0YTg3NGYyZGNhYzBlNTk2ZmQ2NzFhYmMxNWM2Zjk3NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rppol/system-design/commit/8662221193e435053a43fe20f5c958e8e2ffd9b5","sha":"8662221193e435053a43fe20f5c958e8e2ffd9b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/8662221193e435053a43fe20f5c958e8e2ffd9b5"}],"sha":"7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/7771e304a874f2dcac0e596fd671abc15c6f9752"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rppol/system-design/commits/8662221193e435053a43fe20f5c958e8e2ffd9b5/comments","commi