added wifi_handlers.go (was never tracked due to gitignore bug)","tree":{"sha":"635b0a5b3e95c4f22a2485066b784c39856bb8bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/git/trees/635b0a5b3e95c4f22a2485066b784c39856bb8bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/git/commits/0ed0b07be94336b924ff4ac15388df6d27df5a24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/wodeh/__NeXus__/commit/0ed0b07be94336b924ff4ac15388df6d27df5a24","node_id":"C_kwDOSY4LHtoAKDBlZDBiMDdiZTk0MzM2YjkyNGZmNGFjMTUzODhkZjZkMjdkZjVhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wodeh/__NeXus__/commit/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789","sha":"4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789"}],"sha":"0ed0b07be94336b924ff4ac15388df6d27df5a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/0ed0b07be94336b924ff4ac15388df6d27df5a24"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:58:21Z","email":"nexo@moonshot.ai","name":"Nexo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:58:21Z","email":"nexo@moonshot.ai","name":"Nexo"},"message":"feat(wifi): SNMP-based WiFi monitoring module\n\n- Database schema: wifi_access_points, wifi_metrics, wifi_alerts, wifi_floor_summary\n- Migration 021 with demo APs, metrics, and alerts for DOWNTOWN tenant\n- WiFiRepository with full CRUD for APs, metrics, alerts, floor summaries\n- Backend handlers: /v1/wifi/dashboard, /floors, /floors/{id}, /aps, /metrics, /alerts\n- Heatmap endpoint with synthetic signal propagation grid\n- Background SNMP poller worker (simulated for demo, runs every 5 min)\n- Auto-alert generation for poor signal and health degradation\n- Frontend WiFi monitoring page at /wifi with 4 tabs:\n  - Overview: floor cards with signal quality bars\n  - Heatmap: color-coded grid showing signal strength per zone\n  - Alerts: full alert list with resolve action\n  - APs: access point management table\n- WiFi menu added to sidebar\n- Dashboard widget now pulls real data from backend\n- API client functions for all WiFi endpoints","tree":{"sha":"1af774baf05c67d7773d1f8dd99e9eb040c9f9b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/git/trees/1af774baf05c67d7773d1f8dd99e9eb040c9f9b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/git/commits/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/wodeh/__NeXus__/commit/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789","node_id":"C_kwDOSY4LHtoAKDRlNmRjNTI1OTQxMTliN2Q4NjAwMjFmZmI2MmU4ZTNhYzFiYmQ3ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wodeh/__NeXus__/commit/1321a4864ffdb53e8ba8ec21a1ddcd359a1e131f","sha":"1321a4864ffdb53e8ba8ec21a1ddcd359a1e131f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/1321a4864ffdb53e8ba8ec21a1ddcd359a1e131f"}],"sha":"4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/4e6dc52594119b7d860021ffb62e8e3ac1bbd789"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wodeh/__NeXus__/commits/1321a4864ffdb53e8ba8ec21a1ddcd359a1e131f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:46:01Z","email":"nexo@moonshot.ai","name":"Nexo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:46:01Z","email":"nexo@moonshot.ai","name":"Nexo"},"message":"feat(dashboard): draggable widgets, expanded activity, WiFi floor status\n\n- Grid-based draggable dashboard widgets with drag handles\n- Widgets: Arrivals, Departures, Recent Activity, WiFi Status, Revenue\n- Activity filters: all/checkin/checkout/housekeeping/roomservice/alert\n- Activity items link to housekeeping/IPTV room servi