:12Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T22:32:12Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"release: 2026.06.16\n\nCut release 2026.06.16 — solo prep mode (M13) and cross-session\ncitation rendering. Renames the Unreleased section to the version\nper the ADR 0034 same-commit rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c4a050a2b0c3b3c8f90446b87197623fc50db3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/8c4a050a2b0c3b3c8f90446b87197623fc50db3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/c5f3bc2a003716431b9fa1c656e338f7d7b4b93c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/c5f3bc2a003716431b9fa1c656e338f7d7b4b93c","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGM1ZjNiYzJhMDAzNzE2NDMxYjlmYTFjNjU2ZTMzOGY3ZDdiNGI5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/65e10609828d06e3ae5a710b7c6794c353e54ce7","sha":"65e10609828d06e3ae5a710b7c6794c353e54ce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/65e10609828d06e3ae5a710b7c6794c353e54ce7"}],"sha":"c5f3bc2a003716431b9fa1c656e338f7d7b4b93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/c5f3bc2a003716431b9fa1c656e338f7d7b4b93c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/65e10609828d06e3ae5a710b7c6794c353e54ce7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T22:25:53Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T22:30:32Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"solo_prep: open the moderator entry gate for solo sessions\n\nA solo session (ADR 0049) has one participant — the host, who is also\nmoderator — and no debater seat. But the host lands on the moderator\ninvite/lobby route (InviteParticipants), whose \"Enter session\" button is\nhard-gated on `bothDebatersPresent`. With no debaters that gate never\nopens, stranding the host on \"Waiting for both debaters to join.\"\n\nThe gap survived because sp_e2e reached /operate by direct navigation,\nbypassing this lobby gate entirely. The backend was already solo-ready:\nGET /api/sessions/:id returns the `solo` flag and POST .../start has no\ndebater requirement.\n\nMake the lobby solo-aware, flag-gated so the live-debate path is byte-\nfor-byte unchanged:\n- thread `solo` through SessionResponse; derive `isSolo` / `canEnter`\n- gate, Enter button, and handler guard key off `canEnter`\n- in solo: render only the moderator slot (no debater invite links /\n  ready badges) and show a solo banner + hint in place of the\n  debater-waiting copy\n- add moderator.invite.lobby.solo.banner + enterHint.solo across all\n  three locales\n\nAdds four solo-path tests (gate opens with zero debaters; solo banner +\nhint; debater slots suppressed; click POSTs /start then navigates to\n/operate).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57f580bd7ee153d2fb186594c4646bd35a6dbdfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/57f580bd7ee153d2fb186594c4646bd35a6dbdfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/65e10609828d06e3ae5a710b7c6794c353e54ce7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us