nk,\nsd_join_live_link) per the ADR README amendment-pass rule and refinement\nREADME Decisions-immutability rule.\n\n- DESIGN.md — live↔replay round trip, both-affordances live row, end/restart capability, lifecycle-marker cross-ref\n- docs/architecture.md — session-restarted transition, log-derived liveness, new replay entry points, both-affordances discovery row\n- docs/moderator-ui.md — responsibilities recap + F11 (end) / F12 (restart) flows + Modes note\n- docs/adr/0021-event-envelope-discriminated-union-with-zod.md — Amendments: session-restarted fifth lifecycle kind (sl_restart_endpoint, migration 0019)\n- docs/adr/0045-audience-replay-surface-visibility-gating.md — Amendments: widened entry-point set, no visibility widening reaffirmed\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_see_replay_link.md — Amendment (sl_docs, 2026-06-13): D6 relaxed\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_join_live_link.md — Amendment (sl_docs, 2026-06-13): D6 relaxed\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — sl_docs complete 100\n- tasks/99-milestones.tji — m_session_lifecycle complete 100 (M12 fully cleared)\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0021-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5e72243e1a39facb6157e71932631799b7fe834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/e5e72243e1a39facb6157e71932631799b7fe834"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/521231ab490fc3d5e07331e52b129253357af3e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/