.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/56aad19002d20d9492f4272574dc49cf413acdfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:29:43Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:29:43Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_e2e: add cross-surface lifecycle Playwright suite\n\nShips the terminal sl_e2e leaf: a two-journey Playwright suite proving the\nend/restart lifecycle and live↔replay round trip end-to-end on the compose\nstack. This task collects every scenario the six predecessor refinements\ndeferred to it (moderator/participant/audience replay-link landing,\nsession-list see-replay-on-started + join-live-gone-when-ended, go-live\npresent-when-live / absent-when-ended), per the wiring-task-inherits-deferred-\ndebt rule. No production code changes — all six predecessor features are on\nmain; the suite exercises them together in real browser contexts.\n\n- tests/e2e/session-lifecycle-journey.spec.ts: two test() blocks — (A)\n  lifecycle reflected in /sessions/mine (start→both affordances, end→join-\n  live gone, restart→both back; axe over list + operate with end-dialog open);\n  (B) replay cross-links round trip (moderator/participant/audience replay links\n  open /a/replay/:id in new tab + audience-replay-playback renders; go-live\n  navigates same-tab to /a/sessions/:id while live, absent once ended; axe\n  over all four landed routes).\n- playwright.config.ts: added chromium-session-lifecycle project (en-US,\n  setup-auth dependency, alice auth jar, ignoreHTTPSErrors, testMatch for\n  session-lifecycle-journey.spec.ts).\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji: sl_e2e marked complete 100.\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_e2e.md: Status block appended.\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain):\n  - check: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0019-verify-check.log)\n  - vitest: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0019-verify-vitest.log)\n  - cucumber: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0019-verify-cucumber.log)\n  - playwright: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0019-verify-playwright.log)\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac7c9ee0be9ed00f4844619f1b2f3158a1831e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/ac7c9ee0be9ed00f4844619f1b2f3158a1831e8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/56aad19002d20d9492f4272574dc49cf413acdfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/56aad19002d20d9492f4272574dc49cf413acdfc","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDU2YWFkMTkwMDJkMjBkOTQ5MmY0MjcyNTc0ZGM0OWNmNDEzYWNkZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07","sha":"8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07"}],"sha":"56aad19002d20d9492f4272574dc49cf413acdfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/56aad19002d20d9492f4272574dc49cf413acdfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:46:49Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:46:49Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_replay_go_live: add ''Go live'' return link on the audience replay surface\n\nCloses the live↔replay round trip by adding a ''Go live'' affordance to the\naudience replay surface (/a/replay/:sessionId) that returns the viewer to the\nlive audience panel (/a/sessions/:sessionId). The link appears only while the\nloaded event log shows the session is still open (no session-ended event, or a\nsession-restarted follows), derived via a small pure helper (D2) that mirrors\nthe server projection rule — no extra fetch. The link is a plain same-tab <a>\n(D1, no target=\"_blank\"): the replay surface holds no WS subscription to\npreserve. Liveness is derived at the route layer and passed as a prop (D3);\nthe container renders the top-left corner overlay only when isLive is true.\nRefinement: tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_go_live.md.\n\n- apps/audience/src/replay/sessionLiveness.ts — pure isSessionLive(events) helper\n- apps/audience/src/replay/sessionLiveness.test.ts — 5-case unit matrix\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceGoLiveLink.tsx — top-left corner overlay link\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceGoLiveLink.test.tsx — component + i18n parity\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceReplayRoute.tsx — derives isLive, passes prop\n- apps/audience/src/replay/ReplayPlaybackContainer.tsx — isLive prop + overlay\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceReplayRoute.test.tsx — cases (i) live/(j) ended\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/{en-US,pt-BR,es-419}.json — audience.goLiveLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- playwright.config.ts — widened chromium-audience-replay testMatch (D6)\n- tests/e2e/audience-replay-go-live.spec.ts — Playwright: live→present, ended→absent, axe\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100 on sl_replay_go_live\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_go_live.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7fb325cc7227dd9e020dec817c58be9ea30bb8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/a7fb325cc7227dd9e020dec817c58be9ea30bb8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDgzODJmMWI3YmI1NjJiMDIyYzQwYjZiMTIyY2JlOGQwM2YyZTllMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6","sha":"025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6"}],"sha":"8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8382f1b7bb562b022c40b6b122cbe8d03f2e9e07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:00:26Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:00:26Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_replay_navigation.sl_session_list_replay_always: show see-replay on every started discovery row\n\nRelaxes the ended-only gate in seeReplayHref (status \\!== ''ended'' → status === ''lobby'')\nso that both live and ended rows offer the ''see replay'' affordance. A live discovery\nrow now shows join-live + see-replay together, intentionally relaxing the session_discovery\nD6 ''exactly one'' invariant (recorded in the refinement; sl_docs propagates it to the\nsd_see_replay_link/sd_join_live_link refinements and ADR 0045). Lobby rows (no log yet)\nremain replay-less (null). No new component, route, or string — both route pages already\nmount SeeReplayLink beside JoinLiveLink; only the helper''s guard condition changes.\nStale inline comments claiming ''exactly one (D6)'' in both route files and the\nseeReplayHref header table are corrected in lockstep.\n\nRefinement: tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_session_list_replay_always.md\n\n- apps/root/src/discovery/seeReplayHref.ts — gate: \\!== ''ended'' → === ''lobby''; header table updated\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SeeReplayLink.tsx — disjoint-comment corrected\n- apps/root/src/discovery/seeReplayHref.test.ts — CASES: live → ''/a/replay/s1'' (was null)\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SeeReplayLink.test.tsx — \"renders for a live row\" added; lobby-null kept\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.tsx — stale D6 comment corrected\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.test.tsx — live row asserts both links; lobby asserts join-live only\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.tsx — stale D6 comment corrected\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.test.tsx — live public row asserts both affordances\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100 on sl_session_list_replay_always\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_session_list_replay_always.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0015-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b538f5e08030552fd3ebc9a6d795d3488f9138d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/b538f5e08030552fd3ebc9a6d795d3488f9138d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDAyNWEyZDI1M2Y5NWVhZjg1YjkzNTNjYmUxM2YyOGNmMmEzZDk5ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382","sha":"ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382"}],"sha":"025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/025a2d253f95eaf85b9353cbe13f28cf2a3d99d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:26:56Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T23:26:56Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_live_replay_link.sl_replay_link_audience: add Replay link on the audience live route\n\nAdds a localized corner-overlay replay anchor to the broadcast-clean audience\nlive route (`/a/sessions/:sessionId`), closing the `sl_live_replay_link` group\n(third and last of the three live-surface replay links). The chip sits in the\nbottom-right corner (opposite the existing bottom-left `<ChapterMarker>`),\nstyled with the participant compact-affordance palette plus\n`absolute bottom-6 right-6 pointer-events-auto`, and opens\n`/a/replay/${sessionId}` in a new tab (`target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"`)\nwithout disturbing the live WS subscription. Unconditionally present on the\nlive view (any viewer who reaches the graph can also replay it — D3 / ADR 0045).\nOBS-safe by construction: a static optional `<a>` adds none of the input-gating\npatterns the existing `mount.test.tsx` audit forbids.\n\nRefinement: tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_audience.md\n\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceReplayLink.tsx — corner-overlay replay anchor component\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceReplayLink.test.tsx — Vitest component tests (render/label/aria/href/target/rel/focus + 3-locale parity)\n- apps/audience/src/routes/AudienceLiveRoute.tsx — mount AudienceReplayLink as sibling overlay gated on sessionId\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — added audience.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — added audience.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — added audience.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- playwright.config.ts — widened chromium-audience-skeleton testMatch to accept audience-replay-link\n- tests/e2e/audience-replay-link.spec.ts — thin Playwright presence+href+target+axe (WCAG A/AA) spec\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — marked sl_replay_link_audience complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_audience.md — appended Status block\n- tasks/parking-lot.md — parked pristine OBS capture mode (?chrome=none toggle)\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0013-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7025fb63d0d956931cfeb21a2c2acbf41c9e7ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/7025fb63d0d956931cfeb21a2c2acbf41c9e7ac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGNlMjg5ZTllNDdiY2JlZmE4NjBiNGFhNjBkMjliMWYzZTZkNGMzODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836","sha":"179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836"}],"sha":"ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/ce289e9e47bcbefa860b4aa60d29b1f3e6d4c382"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T22:47:08Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T22:47:08Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_live_replay_link.sl_replay_link_participant: add Replay link on the participant operate footer\n\nShips the \"Replay\" affordance on the participant live surface (/p/sessions/:id)\nas specified in tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_participant.md.\nA localized <a> element in the operate footer opens /a/replay/:sessionId in a\nnew tab (target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"), leaving the running operate view and\nits live WS connection intact. The link is unconditionally present on the\noperate footer — visibility is re-enforced at the destination''s server data\nload per ADR 0045; no client-side gate is needed (D3). Styled with the compact\nfooter affordance palette matching the diagnostics toggle sibling (D5). The\ncross-bundle \"opens the replay\" flow is owned by sl_e2e (already in the WBS).\n\n- apps/participant/src/layout/ParticipantReplayLink.tsx — new <a> replay affordance\n- apps/participant/src/layout/ParticipantReplayLink.test.tsx — Vitest/RTL tests (render/href/target/rel/aria/focus + i18n parity)\n- tests/e2e/participant-replay-link.spec.ts — Playwright spec (en-US): presence+href+target+axe WCAG A/AA\n- apps/participant/src/layout/ParticipantOperateFooter.tsx — mounts ParticipantReplayLink in right footer cluster\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — participant.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — participant.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — participant.replayLink.{label,ariaLabel}\n- playwright.config.ts — widened chromium-participant-skeleton testMatch to accept participant-replay-link.spec.ts\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100 on sl_replay_link_participant\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_participant.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0011-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"125e31a7214019b67b6196554711d9deb2650cd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/125e31a7214019b67b6196554711d9deb2650cd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDE3OTMyODkyMGRkN2QyZTBhYmY0ZWYzOGQyNTkxYjdhZDVlNDM4MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32","sha":"04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32"}],"sha":"179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/179328920dd7d2e0abf4ef38d2591b7ad5e43836"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T22:11:30Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T22:11:30Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_live_replay_link.sl_replay_link_moderator: add Replay link on the moderator operate surface\n\nAdds a localized, always-present \"Replay\" anchor to the moderator''s\noperate console (/m/sessions/:id/operate) that opens the session''s\nreplay surface (/a/replay/:sessionId) in a separate tab without\nreplacing the running operate view or tearing down its live WebSocket\nconnection.  The affordance is implemented as an <a> element (not a\n<button>) to reflect that it is read-only cross-bundle navigation\nrequiring no confirm dialog; it reuses the shared BUTTON_CLASSES\nTailwind palette so it sits visually alongside the existing End /\nRestart / Snapshot / Keymap-help buttons in the right-sidebar slot.\nNo client-side visibility gate is applied — the moderator is always\nthe session host (canSeeSession always passes) and ADR 0045 puts the\nprivacy boundary at the server''s data layer.  The href is built\ndirectly as `/a/replay/${sessionId}` (locale-unprefixed, per D2 in the\nrefinement), consistent with the `/a/*` → audience SurfaceHost\ndispatch (ADR 0026).\n\nImplementation follows the task-completion ritual per\ntasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_moderator.md.\n\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/ReplayLinkAction.tsx — new component: localized <a> with target=_blank rel=noopener noreferrer and BUTTON_CLASSES styling\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/ReplayLinkAction.test.tsx — Vitest/RTL tests: render, localized label/aria, href, target, rel, i18n parity\n- apps/moderator/src/routes/Operate.tsx — mount <ReplayLinkAction> as a sibling of the existing operate action buttons\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — add moderator.replayLinkAction.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — add moderator.replayLinkAction.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — add moderator.replayLinkAction.{label,ariaLabel}\n- tests/e2e/moderator-replay-link.spec.ts — thin reachable-surface Playwright spec: link presence, localized label, href ends /a/replay/<id>, target=_blank, axe scan\n- playwright.config.ts — add chromium-replay-link-{en-US,pt-BR,es-419} per-locale projects\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_replay_link_moderator.md — append Status block (Done 2026-06-13)\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — mark sl_replay_link_moderator complete 100\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0009-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7da671c084a4bc144ae9f7127bf96b3113c08f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/7da671c084a4bc144ae9f7127bf96b3113c08f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDA0NDA3MzY3MzY4YmVmOGM3N2ZlMzMzNDJhNGI4OWM1ZjcxNGZkMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8","sha":"4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8"}],"sha":"04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/04407367368bef8c77fe33342a4b89c5f714fd32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T21:36:19Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T21:36:19Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_e2e_browser_install: make test:e2e:compose self-healing for browser install\n\nAdds a `pnpm exec playwright install chromium` step at the top of the\n`test\\:e2e\\:compose` Makefile recipe so first-time contributors no longer\nneed a separate one-time browser install before running the local compose\ne2e target. The step is placed before the compose bring-up so a cold-cache\ndownload overlaps the ~1–2 min stack bring-up rather than serializing after\nit. On a warm cache the step short-circuits to a fast no-op (\"browser is\nalready installed\"). No `--with-deps`: a local Make target must not silently\n`sudo apt-get`; if a system lib is missing, Playwright''s launch error names\nthe fix. CI installs explicitly with `--with-deps` via its own step and\ndoes not use this target.\n\nDocs reconciled per acceptance criteria 5: README.md and\ndocs/dev-environment.md note that `make test:e2e:compose` now installs\nChromium on demand, so the one-time install is no longer a prerequisite for\nthat path (still recommended for the `make up` + `pnpm run test:e2e` loop).\n\nRefinement: tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_e2e_browser_install.md\n\n- Makefile — added `@pnpm exec playwright install chromium` as first step of test:e2e:compose; expanded comment block to document self-healing behavior\n- README.md — updated browser-binaries note to mention on-demand install in test:e2e:compose\n- docs/dev-environment.md — added paragraph marking one-time install optional for compose path\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — `complete 100` for sl_e2e_browser_install\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_e2e_browser_install.md — appended Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0007-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db2322e7061464853a0f54208a4b7b6f9fd5dfab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/db2322e7061464853a0f54208a4b7b6f9fd5dfab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDRhYTE4OGU4MGVkYTQ5YjdiMDZiODQ4Y2E4MjQwMzIwMjJkYWVjYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8","sha":"2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8"}],"sha":"4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/4aa188e80eda49b7b06b848ca824032022daecb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T20:58:36Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T20:58:36Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"sl_mod_lifecycle_actions.sl_mod_restart_action: add Moderator \"Restart session\" button\n\nImplements the visibility-gated \"Restart session\" button on the moderator\noperate console, driving POST /api/sessions/:id/restart. The button renders\nonly when the session is currently ended (derived from the WS event log via\na new isSessionEnded helper). A confirm-before-restart modal mirrors the\nshipped End-session modal: in-flight guard, 409 session-not-ended inline\nerror, generic fallback, localized in en-US/pt-BR/es-419, axe-clean.\n\nPer refinement tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_mod_restart_action.md:\nD2 (copy-and-adapt, no shared ConfirmActionModal yet), D3 (best-effort gate +\n409 race fallback), D4 (local isSessionEnded helper over WS event log), D5\n(close-on-success, no forced navigation), D6 (local error resolver).\n\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/isSessionEnded.ts — derives ended-status from WS event log\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/isSessionEnded.test.ts — end→restart→end unit tests\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/useRestartSessionFlowStore.ts — Zustand flow store\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/RestartSessionActionButton.tsx — gated sidebar button\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/RestartSessionActionButton.test.tsx — visibility/label/click/i18n tests\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/RestartSessionConfirmModal.tsx — accessible confirm dialog\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/RestartSessionConfirmModal.test.tsx — POST shape/409/fallback/in-flight tests\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/RestartSessionConfirmMount.tsx — store-subscribed mount bridge\n- apps/moderator/src/routes/Operate.tsx — wires button + mount into operate console\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — restartSessionAction/restartSessionConfirm keys\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — same, pt-BR\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — same, es-419\n- playwright.config.ts — three chromium-restart-session-<locale> projects\n- tests/e2e/moderator-restart-session.spec.ts — gate-off-while-live + end-via-API + open/Escape/Cancel + axe\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100 on sl_mod_restart_action\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_mod_restart_action.md — Status block\n- tasks/parking-lot.md — ConfirmActionModal consolidation (D2, third-confirm trigger)\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0005-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b5793b210319575a7f7f0d955393b9234d4fb74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/2b5793b210319575a7f7f0d955393b9234d4fb74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDJlMjk2MTcwYWMyMDM0ZGI2YzNhNjNjYzk3M2RmM2M1NmM5MzQ2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778","sha":"94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778"}],"sha":"2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/2e296170ac2034db6c3a63cc973df3c56c9346d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T20:12:28Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T20:12:28Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"sl_mod_lifecycle_actions.sl_mod_end_action: add Moderator \"End session\" button\n\nCloses the gap opened by backend.session_management.end_session_endpoint\n(shipped in M3) which had no operator control. Adds a sidebar \"End session\"\nbutton to the moderator operate console, wired into the right-sidebar slot\nalongside the snapshot action button.\n\nInteraction model (modeled on snapshot action):\n- `EndSessionActionButton` opens a `useEndSessionFlowStore` Zustand store.\n- `EndSessionConfirmModal` issues `POST /api/sessions/:id/end`\n  (`credentials: ''include''`, no body); on 200 the dialog closes.\n- `409 session-already-ended` surfaced as a localized `role=\"alert\"` with\n  `data-error-code` inside the still-open dialog.\n- In-flight guard disables confirm + blocks dismissal until the request\n  settles; generic fallback for non-409 errors.\n- `EndSessionConfirmMount` mounts the overlay bridge in `Operate.tsx`.\n- All user-facing strings in all three catalogs (ADR 0024):\n  `moderator.endSessionAction` + `moderator.endSessionConfirm`.\n- Incidental axe fixes in `CaptureTargetChip`, `ModeBanner`,\n  `PendingProposalsPane` (slate-400/500 → 500/600) so the dialog-open axe\n  scan passes WCAG AA (ADR 0040).\n- Playwright e2e spec (`moderator-end-session.spec.ts`) covering button\n  presence, dialog open/close, and zero-violation axe scan with the dialog\n  open, run under all three per-locale projects.\n\nTech-debt registered:\n  `session_lifecycle.sl_e2e_browser_install` — `make test:e2e:compose`\n  assumes Playwright browsers pre-installed on host; fixer sub-agent had to\n  manually run `pnpm exec playwright install chromium`; add a browser-install\n  or pre-flight check to the local e2e target.\n\nFiles:\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/useEndSessionFlowStore.ts — new: Zustand flow store\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/EndSessionActionButton.tsx — new: sidebar trigger\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/EndSessionActionButton.test.tsx — new: component tests\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/EndSessionConfirmModal.tsx — new: confirm dialog\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/EndSessionConfirmModal.test.tsx — new: component tests\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/EndSessionConfirmMount.tsx — new: overlay bridge\n- apps/moderator/src/routes/Operate.tsx — wire button + mount as sidebar siblings\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — endSessionAction/Confirm keys\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — endSessionAction/Confirm keys\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — endSessionAction/Confirm keys\n- playwright.config.ts — per-locale projects for moderator-end-session spec\n- tests/e2e/moderator-end-session.spec.ts — new: Playwright e2e + axe spec\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/CaptureTargetChip.tsx — axe contrast fix\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/CaptureTargetChip.test.tsx — axe contrast test update\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/ModeBanner.tsx — axe contrast fix\n- apps/moderator/src/layout/PendingProposalsPane.tsx — axe contrast fix\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100 on sl_mod_end_action; register sl_e2e_browser_install tech-debt task\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_mod_end_action.md — new refinement + Done status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0003-*):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7861e8654bb89b85c8a6d71486b016177b1d60bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/7861e8654bb89b85c8a6d71486b016177b1d60bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDk0ZTg2MTRmNmMwZDFhNDNlODcxNDAzY2EwNzMzNDhkNjk3YjY3Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344","sha":"31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344"}],"sha":"94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/94e8614f6c0d1a43e871403ca073348d697b6778"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T11:01:28Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T11:03:05Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_lifecycle.sl_restart_endpoint: ship POST /api/sessions/:id/restart\n\nImplements the backend half of the operator restart control. The endpoint\nmirrors the end endpoint (routes.ts) — moderator-only, visibility-gated,\nlocked row SELECT FOR UPDATE, single-transaction write — but inverts the\nprecondition: 409 `session-not-ended` if the session is not currently ended;\n200 + bare sessionRowToResponse on success (endedAt is null).\n\nThe supporting registration work: SQL migration 0019 drops and re-adds the\nsession_events_kind_check constraint with `session-restarted` appended; the\nnew kind is added to shared-types (eventKinds, empty z.object({}) schema,\neventPayloadSchemas, EventPayloadMap); projection/replay handles it (restores\nprojected state to open, pushes a session-restarted change-feed entry); all\nexhaustive Record<EventKind> maps in validate.test.ts, rekey.ts, and the\nmoderator graph helpers are extended with case arms for the new kind.\n\nBehavior coverage: 5 Cucumber scenarios (host→200 + seq-4 event, 409\nsession-not-ended, 403 non-host, 404 unknown, end→restart round-trip replays\nto open). Vitest: shared-types kind + payload schema + validateEvent; projection\ncreated→ended→restarted projects to open.\n\n- apps/server/src/sessions/routes.ts — POST /api/sessions/:id/restart handler\n- apps/server/migrations/0019_session_events_session_restarted.sql — CHECK constraint migration\n- packages/shared-types/src/events.ts + events.test.ts — session-restarted kind registration\n- apps/server/src/projection/replay.ts + types.ts + replay.test.ts — projection handler\n- apps/server/src/events/validate.test.ts — exhaustive-switch coverage\n- apps/server/src/test-mode/synthetic/rekey.ts — rekey exhaustive arm\n- apps/moderator/src/graph/affectedEntities.ts + eventSummary.ts — moderator graph arms\n- tests/behavior/backend/restart-session.feature + steps/backend-restart-session.steps.ts — Cucumber coverage\n- package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml — added @a-conversa/shared-types workspace dep for step file resolution\n- tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji — complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_lifecycle/sl_restart_endpoint.md — Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0001-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"194707ace2e9cf1e96eddb720f9f1c76dcb84c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/194707ace2e9cf1e96eddb720f9f1c76dcb84c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDMxYjM4ZWYzYTkxNjhjY2U2NzI2NWYyNzY3OGMxNWIyMDk2NjczNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20","sha":"31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20"}],"sha":"31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31b38ef3a9168cce67265f27678c15b209667344"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T09:51:39Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T11:03:05Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"wbs: register session-lifecycle group + M12 milestone\n\nNew task group tasks/77-session-lifecycle.tji (session_lifecycle) and\nmilestone m_session_lifecycle (M12), covering three session-lifecycle\nasks:\n\n  1. End AND restart a debate from the UI — the end endpoint shipped in\n     the M3 backend but never got an operator control; restart is new\n     (a session-restarted event reopens an ended session by clearing\n     ended_at), plus moderator End/Restart buttons.\n  2. A replay link on the live moderator/participant/audience surfaces.\n  3. Always show ''see replay'' in the session list (every started\n     session, not ended-only — intentionally relaxing the\n     session_discovery D6 ''exactly one'' invariant) and a ''go live''\n     return link from replay to the audience panel while live.\n\nPlus sl_e2e and sl_docs to close the group out, mirroring the\nsession-discovery group. Tasks carry summary notes only; refinements\nare written later, one per task. tj3 parses clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2219dd3f15a497c7c5cf1eb3e33201464d1506e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/2219dd3f15a497c7c5cf1eb3e33201464d1506e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDMxODAyNjA0YTc5YzZkODNlZGNlMWI1OGJjOGJmNWQ4NjFjMmJkMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f","sha":"f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f"}],"sha":"31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/31802604a79c6d83edce1b58bc8bf5d861c2bd20"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T09:50:19Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T11:03:05Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"unblocked: omit completed milestones from the full report\n\nThe full `make unblocked` report printed a COMPLETE block for every\nfinished milestone, which now dominates the output (17 of 19 are done).\nSkip finished milestones in the unfiltered report and lead with a\n`(N completed milestones omitted)` note instead. An explicit\n`MILESTONE=<id>` query still shows the milestone even when complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb8ab1e4d7ac93c856395b64f3f340db9bf79249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/cb8ab1e4d7ac93c856395b64f3f340db9bf79249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGY0MWUwMDliNzI5ZWEyMTA5NDMyNmFjMWZhZjc1ZTMyYTFlNDkyNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/ec4957fac9b7acce40b88cecc930756ac15d9092","sha":"ec4957fac9b7acce40b88cecc930756ac15d9092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/ec4957fac9b7acce40b88cecc930756ac15d9092"}],"sha":"f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/f41e009b729ea21094326ac1faf75e32a1e4925f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/ec4957fac9b7acce40b88cecc930756ac15d9092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T10:19:54Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T10:19:54Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"sessions: idiomatic per-route rate limits on /mine and /public\n\nThe autofix for code-scanning alert #11 hand-rolled an in-memory\nMap-based rate limiter on GET /api/sessions/mine, with a non-canonical\n''too-many-requests'' error code and an unbounded store (memory leak).\nReplace it with the idiomatic @fastify/rate-limit per-route override\n(config.rateLimit) — consistent with the global limiter already\nregistered in createServer, which renders the canonical ''rate-limited''\n429 envelope via its errorResponseBuilder.\n\nAlso fold in the alert-autofix-12 change: the same config.rateLimit\nblock on the anonymous GET /api/sessions/public discovery surface.\n\nBoth are additive tighter overrides (100 req / minute) on top of the\ngenerous global per-IP default. Drops the now-unused FastifyRequest /\nFastifyReply type imports.\n\nCloses CodeQL js/missing-rate-limiting alerts #11 and #12.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8aa3cd456515341ce5a46a68dd6ab7b5a637bdbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/8aa3cd456515341ce5a46a68dd6ab7b5a637bdbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/ec4957fac9b7acce40b88cecc930756ac15d9092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruo