rsa/commit/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda","sha":"38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda"}],"sha":"bc7a996e933f0b51652fe04bbb6c4e12f1ac37c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/bc7a996e933f0b51652fe04bbb6c4e12f1ac37c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:06:22Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:06:22Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_docs: fold session discovery into DESIGN.md, architecture.md, and ADR 0029\n\nDocs-only pass recording the finished Session Discovery feature (M11) in the\ncanonical prose docs. No code, schema, or test changes — every behavioral\nclaim is already pinned by the committed Cucumber endpoint scenarios and\ntests/e2e/discovery-flows.spec.ts.\n\nDESIGN.md gains a \"Finding and entering sessions\" account: My Sessions vs\nPublic Sessions, the lobby-secrecy promise, and the role-aware entry matrix\ninto the existing /m / /p / /a surfaces. docs/architecture.md adds \"Session\nlifecycle markers\" (started_at / ended_at), \"Session discovery\" under\nSessions (both listing endpoints, the started_at gate verbatim, WS-vs-HTTP\ndivergence), and \"Discovery surface\" under Frontend surfaces (/sessions and\n/sessions/mine with the role×lifecycle dispatch table). ADR 0029''s stale\n\"HTTP routes continue to require a valid cookie\" Consequence is corrected\nin place to carve out the anonymous read-only GET /api/sessions/public\nlisting, with a new 2026-06-13 Amendments entry; Context/Decision and the\nprior 2026-06-05 amendment are untouched.\n\n- DESIGN.md — added \"Finding and entering sessions\" section with lobby-secrecy rule and role-aware entry\n- docs/architecture.md — added lifecycle markers, discovery endpoints, and discovery surface sections\n- docs/adr/0029-anonymous-ws-subscribe-for-public-sessions.md — amended Consequence + new Amendments entry\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — sd_docs complete 100\n- tasks/99-milestones.tji — m_session_discovery complete 100 (all session_discovery.* leaves done)\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_docs.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0019-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcac4f23cd61aaa3762bf3a51d2d36452e6468fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/fcac4f23cd61aaa3762bf3a51d2d36452e6468fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDM4MjQ4YTVmNmExZmUwNzhkNTAxYTM1MjU1YmRhMmFmNDUyYWNkZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89","sha":"b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89"}],"sha":"38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/38248a5f6a1fe078d501a35255bda2af452acdda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:37:21Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:37:21Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_e2e: add Playwright e2e discovery-flows spec\n\nCloses the cross-surface and ended-row gap in the session discovery\nfeature by adding a single multi-context Playwright spec that drives the\nassembled surfaces against the compose stack with the seeded user pool.\nCovers the journeys no single-page spec can exercise: the host/debater\nrole matrix routing into /m and /p, anonymous join-live → /a, see-replay\n→ /a/replay, lobby-secrecy + privacy gating at the public-list UI seam,\nfunctional date-filter + pagination walk, and a WCAG A/AA axe scan on a\nlist containing an ended row. Seeding is done through the real API flow\n(POST /api/sessions, /start, /end, /invite/claim from authedContexts)\nper the established page-spec convention and ADR 0022.\n\n- tests/e2e/discovery-flows.spec.ts — 8 test() cases: AC1 role matrix, AC2 lobby routing, AC3 public lobby-secrecy + privacy, AC4 anon join-live, AC5 see-replay, AC6a date-filter, AC6b pagination, AC7 axe ended-row\n- playwright.config.ts — added chromium-discovery-flows project (setup-auth dep, en-US, alice jar)\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — complete 100 on sd_e2e\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_e2e.md — appended ## Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0017-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"653050749967421a40ab6bef671b20afab801696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/653050749967421a40ab6bef671b20afab801696"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGIzMmI3ZWJkMDUyNjc1MDNkOWEwMDdjZGM0ODM3NzY5ZGZjYTdhODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793","sha":"13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793"}],"sha":"b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/b32b7ebd05267503d9a007cdc4837769dfca7a89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T04:59:33Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T04:59:33Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_see_replay_link: add \"See replay\" affordance to discovery pages\n\nAdds a per-row \"See replay\" link to both My Sessions and Public Sessions lists,\nrouting ended rows to the audience replay surface at /a/replay/:id. The affordance\nis ended-only (endedAt \\!= null) and role-agnostic — replay visibility is enforced\nat the audience route by session privacy per ADR 0045, not by caller role — so\nboth lists show the same link. It is disjoint from join-live (lobby/live), so each\nrow exposes exactly one primary action. Implementation follows the sd_join_live_link\npattern exactly: a pure seeReplayHref helper + a thin localized SeeReplayLink\ncomponent, wired into the shared renderRowActions slot of both pages beside the\nexisting badge/join-live affordances.\n\n- apps/root/src/discovery/seeReplayHref.ts — pure (row) → href|null helper\n- apps/root/src/discovery/seeReplayHref.test.ts — 3 lifecycle cases: ended→href, live→null, lobby→null\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SeeReplayLink.tsx — localized <Link> component, renders null when href is null\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SeeReplayLink.test.tsx — ended href+a11y label; null for live/lobby\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.tsx — SeeReplayLink wired beside SessionRoleBadge+JoinLiveLink\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.test.tsx — ended row shows see-replay+badge, no join-live\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.tsx — SeeReplayLink wired beside JoinLiveLink\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.test.tsx — ended public row shows see-replay, no join-live\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — discovery.seeReplay.{label,ariaLabel} added\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — discovery.seeReplay.{label,ariaLabel} added\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — discovery.seeReplay.{label,ariaLabel} added\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — sd_see_replay_link marked complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_see_replay_link.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23f0fb09930fb61cab266260e035536e63550225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/23f0fb09930fb61cab266260e035536e63550225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDEzYjVhODg4NjUxMGQ3NzhkNDBkZjQyZTYwZjVlN2IxNjIzODI3OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913","sha":"db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913"}],"sha":"13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/13b5a8886510d778d40df42e60f5e7b162382793"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T04:29:56Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T04:29:56Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_join_live_link: add role-aware \"join live\" routing to discovery pages\n\nImplements the per-row \"join live\" affordance for both discovery pages, routing\ncallers to the correct micro-frontend surface based on role and lifecycle state:\nhost/moderator → /m/*, debater-A/-B → /p/*, anonymous/audience → /a/*. Lobby\nsessions route to the lobby view; live sessions to operate/participate. The\nrouting logic lives in a pure `joinLiveHref(row, role)` helper (exhaustively\nunit-tested over all 15 matrix cells) and a thin localized `<JoinLiveLink>`\ncomponent. Both discovery pages wire the component into their `renderRowActions`\nslot, keeping `SessionList` role-agnostic per Constraint 4. i18n keys\n`discovery.joinLive.{label,ariaLabel}` added to all three locales. Accessibility\ncolor contrast corrected to WCAG AA (bg-emerald-700, ~4.8:1).\n\n- apps/root/src/discovery/joinLiveHref.ts — pure routing helper (15-cell matrix)\n- apps/root/src/discovery/joinLiveHref.test.ts — exhaustive matrix unit test (Vitest)\n- apps/root/src/discovery/JoinLiveLink.tsx — localized link component (renders nothing on null href)\n- apps/root/src/discovery/JoinLiveLink.test.tsx — RTL component test (href/labels/null-render)\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.tsx — renderRowActions wired: role badge + join-live link\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.test.tsx — extended with join-live wiring assertions\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.tsx — renderRowActions added: join-live link → /a/sessions/:id\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.test.tsx — extended with join-live wiring assertions\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — discovery.joinLive.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — discovery.joinLive.{label,ariaLabel}\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — discovery.joinLive.{label,ariaLabel}\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — sd_join_live_link marked complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_join_live_link.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0013-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d5aa8fbb4fe63dfd4450224602a4500b48b45cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/2d5aa8fbb4fe63dfd4450224602a4500b48b45cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGRiNjg1ZjA1N2VlMWUwMWFkNGY2M2NlYTM0OWM0MTdmMzkyNTc5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f","sha":"51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f"}],"sha":"db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/db685f057ee1e01ad4f63cea349c417f39257913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T03:38:46Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T03:38:46Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_my_sessions_page: add authenticated My Sessions page\n\nShips the authenticated /sessions/mine route, mounting the shared SessionList\nagainst the credentialed /api/sessions/mine endpoint, with per-row role badges\nand a signed-in landing entry link. Gated behind the existing sign-in bounce\n(rememberReturnTo + Navigate to /login / /screen-name), localized in all three\nlocales. Roles are correlated outside the component via a stable roleById ref +\nuseCallback adapter, keeping SessionListRow endpoint-ignorant (D3). Lobby rows\nsurface (lobbyRowsPossible default true). Two fixer fixes: viewport overflow\nbounded with h-screen/overflow-y-auto and anonymous Playwright context made\ntruly anonymous via explicit storageState.\n\nSee tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_my_sessions_page.md.\n\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.tsx — auth-gated route, inlined gate, stable roleById ref + useCallback fetch adapter\n- apps/root/src/discovery/mySessionsFetcher.ts — credentialed fetchMySessions returning { rows, total, roles }\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SessionRoleBadge.tsx — localized, accessible role badge (debater-A/B → debater)\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.test.tsx — auth gate × 4 statuses, credentialed fetch, role badges, lobby rows\n- apps/root/src/routes/MySessionsRoute.a11y.test.tsx — axe structural pins\n- apps/root/src/discovery/mySessionsFetcher.test.ts — querystring / credentialed / role-map\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SessionRoleBadge.test.tsx — mapping / labels / aria\n- tests/e2e/my-sessions-page.spec.ts — auth-bounce, host-badge + lobby-row render, search/empty/pagination, landing reachability, axe scan\n- apps/root/src/App.tsx — route /sessions/mine registered\n- apps/root/src/landing/CallToActionSection.tsx — authed \"My sessions\" link\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/{en-US,pt-BR,es-419}.json — discovery.mySessions.*, landing.cta.viewMySessions\n- playwright.config.ts — chromium-my-sessions project\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — complete 100 on sd_my_sessions_page\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_my_sessions_page.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain):\n  - check: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0011-verify-check.log)\n  - vitest: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0011-verify-vitest.log)\n  - cucumber: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0011-verify-cucumber.log)\n  - playwright: PASS (log: orchestrator/logs/iter-0011-verify-playwright.log)\n\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3407dbf8fcfc3768b3960b95a87e4fab2e43826d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/3407dbf8fcfc3768b3960b95a87e4fab2e43826d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDUxZWYxODQ0YjMwNGRhNWE3YmQwMzdkNWZjNzU1OTQ2YTc0MTUwMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585","sha":"fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585"}],"sha":"51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/51ef1844b304da5a7bd037d5fc755946a741502f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T02:26:39Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T02:26:39Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_public_sessions_page: add anonymous Public Sessions page\n\nImplements the anonymous /sessions route in the root app, wiring the shared\nSessionList component to the public endpoint and making the public discovery\nsurface reachable from the landing page CTA. This is the last wiring step\nbefore the row-action link tasks (sd_join_live_link, sd_see_replay_link) can\nplug their affordances in. Also discharges the deferred Playwright/axe debt\nfor the public list that the SessionList component refinement named this task\nas one of its three e2e targets.\n\n- apps/root/src/discovery/publicSessionsFetcher.ts — anonymous fetcher, no credentials (ADR 0029)\n- apps/root/src/discovery/publicSessionsFetcher.test.ts — Vitest: querystring, mapping, anonymous posture\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.tsx — /sessions route, lobbyRowsPossible={false}, no row actions (D4)\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.test.tsx — Vitest: heading, rows, lobby-exclusion note absent\n- apps/root/src/routes/PublicSessionsRoute.a11y.test.tsx — structural axe scan\n- tests/e2e/public-sessions-page.spec.ts — Playwright: landing link, started-list render, lobby-secrecy UI pin, search/empty/pagination, axe WCAG-AA\n- apps/root/src/App.tsx — /sessions route registered\n- apps/root/src/landing/CallToActionSection.tsx — \"Browse public sessions\" link added to CTA row\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/{en-US,pt-BR,es-419}.json — discovery.publicSessions.{title,subtitle} + landing.cta.browsePublicSessions\n- playwright.config.ts — chromium-public-sessions project added (deps on setup-auth)\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — sd_public_sessions_page marked complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_public_sessions_page.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0009-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b036d427752d9048eee74eb11f18c8a46d81b46b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/b036d427752d9048eee74eb11f18c8a46d81b46b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGZiZWUxMzEyNjc3OGUzMWRkNjQyOGQ1ZDg1OWFhMjU4NTg3OTA1ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc","sha":"d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc"}],"sha":"fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/fbee13126778e31dd6428d5d859aa25858790585"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:42:38Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:42:38Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_session_list_component: add shared paginated session-list component\n\nImplements the shared React component that backs both the My Sessions and\nPublic Sessions discovery pages, per tasks/refinements/session_discovery/\nsd_session_list_component.md.\n\nThe component is data-source-agnostic: it owns query state (debounced topic\nsearch, date-range filter, offset-based pagination), the 3-char search\nminimum, pagination arithmetic, and loading/empty/error rendering. The\nmounting page injects (a) an async fetchPage fetcher wired to its endpoint\nand (b) a per-row renderRowActions slot for role badges and join-live /\nsee-replay links — keeping endpoint, auth posture, and row-shape differences\nout of the shared component (Decision D2/D3).\n\nLocalized in en-US, pt-BR, and es-419 via a new top-level discovery.* key\nblock added to all three catalogs (Decision D6). Full Playwright + axe\ncoverage deferred to the pre-existing WBS leaves sd_my_sessions_page,\nsd_public_sessions_page, and sd_e2e, which make the component route-reachable\n(Decision D8).\n\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SessionList.tsx — component implementation\n- apps/root/src/discovery/SessionList.test.tsx — 14 Vitest specs (criteria 2–9)\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/en-US.json — discovery.* block\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/pt-BR.json — discovery.* block\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/src/catalogs/es-419.json — discovery.* block\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — complete 100 for sd_session_list_component\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_session_list_component.md — Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0007-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f506ca99d9271b9e5c0ee82372849cf8ca2e8e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/f506ca99d9271b9e5c0ee82372849cf8ca2e8e1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGQyZGEzMmE2MWUyY2JkZjU5YjYzYTg0YjlkNjRjNzhiODY2MDdkZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256","sha":"d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256"}],"sha":"d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d2da32a61e2cbdf59b63a84b9d64c78b86607dfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:01:47Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:01:47Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_public_sessions_endpoint: add GET /api/sessions/public (anonymous, started-only)\n\nImplements the anonymous public-session discovery endpoint per\ntasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_public_sessions_endpoint.md.\nMirrors the sd_my_sessions_endpoint pattern with three key differences:\nno preHandler (anonymous), a fixed privacy=''public'' AND started_at IS NOT NULL\ngate (the load-bearing lobby-secrecy constraint), and a narrower\nPublicSessionResponse of exactly {id, topic, startedAt, endedAt}.\n\n- apps/server/src/sessions/routes.ts — PublicSessionResponse/PublicSessionListResponse\n  schemas, publicListSessionsQuerystringSchema, PublicSessionRow mapper, schema\n  registrations, anonymous GET /api/sessions/public handler with two-query pagination\n  and ORDER BY started_at DESC, created_at DESC\n- apps/server/src/sessions/routes.test.ts — mock-pool branches for the public-gate\n  page and count queries; 4 new Vitest unit tests (shape/fields-only, gate excludes\n  lobby+private, cookie-ignored, over-cap 400)\n- tests/behavior/backend/public-sessions.feature — lobby-secrecy gate, live+ended\n  inclusion, no-cookie 200, cookie-doesn''t-widen, fields-only, ordering, topic/date\n  filter, over-cap 400, pagination scenarios\n- tests/behavior/steps/backend-public-sessions.steps.ts — pglite-backed step defs\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_public_sessions_endpoint.md — Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0005-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"923fb077da1c929799471e3e6858522b9f8069f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/923fb077da1c929799471e3e6858522b9f8069f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGQxM2U2ZDY5Y2Y2OGFkZThhZmNmNGYxNGVjMmNhMmY5NTg5Y2IyNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5","sha":"c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5"}],"sha":"d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/d13e6d69cf68ade8afcf4f14ec2ca2f9589cb256"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:28:08Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:28:08Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_my_sessions_endpoint: add GET /api/sessions/mine (authenticated, role-annotated)\n\nImplements the My Sessions endpoint per\ntasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_my_sessions_endpoint.md.\n\nNew authenticated route returns sessions where the caller is host OR\nholds any session_participants row (including historical), each row\nannotated with a single precedence-resolved role (host > active\nparticipant > historical participant). Membership gate is a bare\nEXISTS — no visibility gate. Includes lobby (NULL started_at) and\nended sessions. Sorted lobby-first (NULLS FIRST), then descending\nstart time, with created_at as stable tiebreak. Two-query pagination\n(page + COUNT(*)::int total); reuses existing search/offset caps.\n\n- apps/server/src/sessions/routes.ts — new GET /api/sessions/mine route,\n  MySessionResponse/MySessionListResponse schemas, myListSessionsQuerystringSchema,\n  mySessionRowToResponse mapper, schema registration\n- apps/server/src/sessions/routes.test.ts — 11 Vitest cases (shape/mapping,\n  host/moderator/debater roles, non-member absence, lobby-first ordering,\n  role precedence, topic + startedAfter filtering, over-cap-offset 400,\n  pagination/total, 401)\n- tests/behavior/backend/my-sessions.feature — 10 Cucumber scenarios (criteria 2–7)\n- tests/behavior/steps/backend-my-sessions.steps.ts — step definitions\n- tasks/75-session-discovery.tji — complete 100\n- tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_my_sessions_endpoint.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0003-verify-*.log):\n  - pnpm run check — green.\n  - pnpm run test:smoke — green.\n  - pnpm run test:behavior:smoke — green.\n  - make test:e2e:compose — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccf3d9b8e8193a5120015966333cdb64734ed78b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/ccf3d9b8e8193a5120015966333cdb64734ed78b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGM3YmFmYzVkMGEzOGRjYTE0MTY0MGNkYmQ3ZTllODQwZGVkODAyZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/5273ff8add6f66bc25f41f097948d4fb25ded4cf","sha":"5273ff8add6f66bc25f41f097948d4fb25ded4cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/5273ff8add6f66bc25f41f097948d4fb25ded4cf"}],"sha":"c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/c7bafc5d0a38dca141640cdbd7e9e840ded802d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/5273ff8add6f66bc25f41f097948d4fb25ded4cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:35:24Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:35:24Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"session_discovery.sd_schema: add started_at column, backfill, go-forward writer\n\nImplements the schema foundation for the session-discovery feature\n(tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_schema.md). The sessions table\ngains a denormalized `started_at TIMESTAMPTZ NULL` read-model column —\nthe lobby-secrecy predicate and sort key both discovery list endpoints\ndepend on. Per Decision D1, `session_events` stays the source of truth;\n`started_at` is the indexed projection.\n\nMigration 0018 (forward-only, ADR 0020; backward-compatible, ADR 0034):\n  - ADD COLUMN started_at TIMESTAMPTZ NULL to sessions\n  - backfill from earliest session-mode-changed → operate event via the\n    existing session_events_session_kind_idx\n  - CREATE INDEX sessions_public_started_idx ON sessions (started_at DESC)\n    WHERE privacy = ''public'' AND started_at IS NOT NULL\n\nThe single writer (Decision D2) is folded into this task: POST\n/api/sessions/:id/start gains an UPDATE sessions SET started_at = NOW()\ninside the existing transaction; idempotent re-POST leaves the column\nunchanged. A mock-pool handler for that branch was added to the Vitest\nsuite after the initial implementation triggered a catch-all 500.\n\nBehavior tests (Cucumber, pglite, ADR 0022):\n  - tests/behavior/backend/session-start.feature — go-forward write\n    scenarios (lobby has NULL; start sets non-NULL; idempotent re-POST\n    does not move it)\n  - tests/behavior/migrations/sessions-started-at-backfill.feature —\n    backfill behavior (row with prior event gets timestamp; row with no\n    event stays NULL)\n\nTopic search (`ILIKE`, no trigram index, Decision D4) surfaced to\ntasks/parking-lot.md for human review when real-show volumes are known.\n\nFiles changed:\n  - apps/server/migrations/0018_sessions_started_at.sql  (new — migration)\n  - apps/server/src/sessions/routes.ts  (started_at writer in start endpoint)\n  - apps/server/src/sessions/routes.test.ts  (mock-pool handler + interface)\n  - tests/behavior/backend/session-start.feature  (go-forward scenarios)\n  - tests/behavior/steps/backend-session-start.steps.ts  (step glue)\n  - tests/behavior/migrations/sessions-started-at-backfill.feature  (new)\n  - tests/behavior/steps/sessions-started-at-backfill.steps.ts  (new)\n  - tests/behavior/support/migrate.ts  (pglite migration support)\n  - tasks/75-session-discovery.tji  (complete 100 for sd_schema)\n  - tasks/refinements/session_discovery/sd_schema.md  (Status block)\n  - tasks/parking-lot.md  (D4 trigram-index future note)\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"298b73594d11b0f79efdea04e8406d2448a32e62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/298b73594d11b0f79efdea04e8406d2448a32e62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/5273ff8add6f66bc25f41f097948d4fb25ded4cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu