 Railway Pro monitors; external probe deferred\n\nOperator upgraded to Railway Pro and configured threshold monitors\n(resource metrics, native email + in-app) from the Observability\ndashboard. The external synthetic probe of /readyz + the OIDC issuer\n— the only layer that sees user-vantage failures, as both bring-up\nincidents demonstrated — is a recorded deferral to revisit before the\nfirst public show, with BetterStack leaned-to (its inbound-webhook\ningestion would also give Railway''s HTTP-only deploy-state webhook an\nemail path). Refinement authored; ADR 0033 amended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b83f475cac90b6046a08fcdd417447683f9720fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/b83f475cac90b6046a08fcdd417447683f9720fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/de58cd7a87272226f66f1077fb96515c737c037f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/de58cd7a87272226f66f1077f