sfy the new\nCHECKs and uniqueness unchanged) — safety linter clean over the\n18-file corpus. Six new behavior scenarios in edges.feature pin\nannotation-endpoint inserts, XOR rejections, duplicate rejection\nover the widened tuple, and the annotation FK; suite green (327\nscenarios). Surfaced by the 2026-06-12 open-leaf audit (orphan leaf,\nwired to no milestone).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DvMKWDvua4viQKpPgrZCDQ","tree":{"sha":"8c272d0f6c006cc2d83308139aac4d39a9c4678f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/8c272d0f6c006cc2d83308139aac4d39a9c4678f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/da9a6a800bdb7dc72cf5c7526a595f6388549d97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/da9a6a800bdb7dc72cf5c7526a595f6388549d97","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGRhOWE2YTgwMGJkYjdkYzcyY2Y1Yzc1MjZhNTk1ZjYzODg1NDlkOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/f54ee3063b9f065f62af3a299535f5ab7ef7b2f4","sha":"f