od_container,\nas one Dockerfile rework: (1) prod_dockerfile — new prod-deps stage\nperforming a server-closure-filtered production install\n(--filter @a-conversa/server...; the frontends ship as static dist\nand need no runtime node_modules, so react/cytoscape/i18next never\nenter the runtime image), runtime stage copies the tree wholesale\nand no longer touches corepack/pnpm; production posture documented\n(plain-node PID 1 with in-server signal handlers, USER node,\nNODE_ENV). (2) prod_image_minimization — runtime layer hardening in\na single RUN: apk upgrade --no-cache plus removal of the base\nimage''s npm/corepack/yarn (nothing in the runtime references them).\nADR 0015 Amendment records the pass; distroless considered and\ndeferred post-v1. Validation on a runner via the rollback-rehearsal\nworkflow (temporary branch trigger + temporary size-comparison /\npackage-manager spot-check step, removed at completion).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DvMKWDvua4viQKpPgrZCDQ","tree":{"sha":"f681a8852fa9a2d7c6a7b2f0a85d0c47c8e560b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/f681a8852fa9a2d7c6a7b2f0a85d0c47c8e560b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/343e408719d0345e7b3c222422c79af46a66c866","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com