Fastify error handler inside createServer(), guarded on\nisInitialized() so test instances stay byte-identical. Error\ntracking only: no tracing config, sendDefaultPii off, environment\nfrom NODE_ENV, release shared with /healthz via resolveServerVersion.\nsentry.test.ts pins the no-op path, the armed options, and a\nbeforeSend capture-and-drop e2e (route throws -> event enrolled,\ncanonical envelope intact, nothing leaves the process). Docs:\nobservability.md Error tracking section; SENTRY_DSN in .env.example.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DvMKWDvua4viQKpPgrZCDQ","tree":{"sha":"5619393ab43d5d81a4480f2348e7483191f23510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/5619393ab43d5d81a4480f2348e7483191f23510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/7817097a15f602a7b9b0a94ecd854b9aa9abb7f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/7817097a15f602a7b9b0a94ecd854b9aa9abb7f7","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDc4MTcwOTdhMTVmNjAyYTdiO