eck failing flips the response to 503 with per-check detail.\nExplicit SKIP_STARTUP_MIGRATIONS counts as migrations-ok (operator\nassertion); missing DATABASE_URL does not. /readyz joins the\nrate-limit allow-list so Railway''s deploy-health probe and the uptime\nmonitor are never throttled. /healthz unchanged (liveness-only).\nNew readyz.test.ts suite + a /readyz rate-limit pin in server.test.ts;\ndocs/observability.md gains the Health and readiness section.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DvMKWDvua4viQKpPgrZCDQ","tree":{"sha":"9a9ccc628eef63226c3d2b88e1e9e7d31557a76c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/9a9ccc628eef63226c3d2b88e1e9e7d31557a76c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/310417fda9392b04489bf79614f6afbea445c43b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/310417fda9392b04489bf79614f6afbea445c43b","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDMxMDQxN2ZkYTkzOTJiMDQ0ODliZjc5NjE0ZjZhZmJlYTQ0NWM0M2I","parents":[{"html_url