r-key call\nconventions, never-log list with the redact backstop, LOG_LEVEL and\nthe three NODE_ENV modes). Sibling observability leaves extend the\nsame document. Refinement + complete-100 marker per the completion\nritual; tj3 parse clean.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DvMKWDvua4viQKpPgrZCDQ","tree":{"sha":"f20b3aba80f20d2b703fc2a1cb93f09a1f234043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/f20b3aba80f20d2b703fc2a1cb93f09a1f234043"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/a04eccefd1829838d873dcdf5b9ac8c97ddd6913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/a04eccefd1829838d873dcdf5b9ac8c97ddd6913","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGEwNGVjY2VmZDE4Mjk4MzhkODczZGNkZjViOWFjOGM5N2RkZDY5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07","sha":"8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07"}],"sha":"a04eccefd1829838d873dcdf5b9ac8c97ddd6913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/a04eccefd1829838d873dcdf5b9ac8c97ddd6913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:43:58Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:43:58Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"post_implementation_audits.per_facet_step_pill: Playwright behavior pin, dense-graph OBS audit, footer-band fix, halo decision\n\nCloses the remaining ~1.5d scope of per_facet_step_pill: the Playwright\nbehavior pin on both reachable surfaces (audience step-pill spec + landing\nclassification-beat assertion), the dense-graph OBS-1080p audit scenario\n(the agent-checkable half of the ADR 0004 performance gate, Decision §11a),\nand the conditional footer-band height fix for decorated nodes. The halo\nquestion (Decision §10) is resolved as retain-overlays — decision only, no\ncode change.\n\nSee tasks/refinements/post_implementation_audits/per_facet_step_pill.md for\nfull scope and decisions.\n\n- packages/graph-view/src/projectGraph.ts — conditional FOOTER_BAND_PX=28 via footerBandPx() at both height call sites\n- packages/graph-view/src/projectGraph.test.ts — Vitest (fb1)–(fb4): footer band on axiom-marked/annotated nodes, no stacking, survives reword\n- tests/e2e/audience-step-pill.spec.ts (new) — scenarios (a) wording pill, (b) Classification: Fact ✓/✗, (c) settled chip, (d) 40-node OBS audit\n- playwright.config.ts — new chromium-audience-step-pill project entry\n- tests/e2e/landing-demo.spec.ts — .gv-pill assertion in desktop beat walk\n- tasks/95-post-implementation-audits.tji — complete 100 for per_facet_step_pill\n- tasks/99-milestones.tji — complete 100 for m_audits (all deps now met)\n- tasks/parking-lot.md — OBS compositing smoothness human checkpoint (Decision §11b)\n- tasks/refinements/post_implementation_audits/per_facet_step_pill.md — Status block\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0007-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7b09076d1922cfffe0ae1eee2a49cb18f321df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/e7b09076d1922cfffe0ae1eee2a49cb18f321df3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDgzODMyNTFkOGQ0Zjc3YThhNDNmYmJkNDBjZmZmZWE0N2MyNmJlMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964","sha":"3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964"}],"sha":"8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/8383251d8d4f77a8a43fbbd40cfffea47c26be07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:55:58Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:55:58Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"moderator_ui.mod_graph_rendering.mod_decompose_split_parent_visibility: parent supersession derived client-side, all three canvases enforced\n\nPer ADR 0047, superseded nodes (decompose / interpretive-split / edit-wording.restructure)\nare now filtered from the moderator, participant, and audience/replay graphs at commit, with\nincident edges dropped via the missing-endpoint rule. A pure `computeSupersededNodeIds` helper\nextracted from graph-view''s donor walk lives in @a-conversa/shell and is consumed by all three\nprojectors. The dead `decomposed` fade seam in graph-view is removed. E2e specs reworked: AC-5b\ndeferral in full-session-walkthrough is replaced with the live N14 parent-removal assertion;\nmethodology-full-flow Phases 6.2–11.x retargeted to nodes visible after the decompose commit.\n\n- packages/shell/src/supersession/supersession.ts — new: computeSupersededNodeIds helper\n- packages/shell/src/supersession/supersession.test.ts — new: 6-case Vitest suite\n- packages/shell/src/supersession/index.ts — new: barrel export\n- packages/shell/src/index.ts — re-export supersession helper\n- apps/moderator/src/graph/GraphCanvasPane.tsx — wire computeSupersededNodeIds; filter nodes\n- apps/moderator/src/graph/GraphCanvasPane.test.tsx — 2 new cases: superseded-parent filtering\n- apps/moderator/src/graph/selectors.ts — filter superseded-endpoint edges\n- apps/moderator/src/graph/selectors.test.ts — 2 new cases incl. ADR 0046 inherited-edge survival\n- apps/participant/src/graph/projectGraph.ts — wire helper; filter nodes and edges\n- apps/participant/src/graph/projectGraph.test.ts — 3 new cases incl. mirror-source + inherited-edge\n- packages/graph-view/src/projectGraph.ts — refactor onto shared helper (no behavior change)\n- packages/graph-view/src/projectGraph.test.ts — suite stays green through extraction\n- packages/graph-view/src/GraphView.tsx — remove decomposed fade seam wiring\n- packages/graph-view/src/GraphView.test.tsx — remove dead-seam pins\n- packages/graph-view/src/stylesheet.ts — remove node[?decomposed] arm\n- packages/graph-view/src/overlays.css — remove .decomposed-fade rule\n- packages/graph-view/src/overlays.css.test.ts — remove dead fade test\n- packages/graph-view/src/DecompositionFadeOverlay.tsx — deleted (dead seam)\n- packages/graph-view/src/DecompositionFadeOverlay.test.tsx — deleted (dead seam)\n- docs/adr/0047-parent-supersession-client-derived-from-commit.md — new ADR\n- docs/adr/0027-entity-and-facet-layers-strict-separation.md — amendment entry appended\n- tests/e2e/full-session-walkthrough.spec.ts — AC-5b deferral replaced with live assertion\n- tests/e2e/methodology-full-flow.spec.ts — Phases 6.2–11.x retargeted off superseded N1\n- tasks/30-moderator-ui.tji — complete 100 for mod_decompose_split_parent_visibility\n- tasks/refinements/moderator-ui/mod_decompose_split_parent_visibility.md — Status block appended\n\nVerification (driver-run, deterministic chain — see orchestrator/logs/iter-0005-verify-*.log):\n  - `pnpm run check` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:smoke` — green.\n  - `pnpm run test:behavior:smoke` — green.\n  - `make test:e2e:compose` — green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd688b30e3eee2b2b4de4512f57687cc8a0f8a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/dd688b30e3eee2b2b4de4512f57687cc8a0f8a13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKDNjYjdmNGE0YzFlMTc3ODQ1ZTA3ZmE0MzE3MWViMTQyNWFhOTY5NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5","sha":"b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5"}],"sha":"3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/3cb7f4a4c1e177845e07fa43171eb1425aa96964"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/commits/b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:50:11Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T11:54:06Z","email":"daniel@ruoso.com","name":"Daniel Ruoso"},"message":"i18n: markdown review sheets for native-speaker translation pass\n\nImplements the reviewer workflow for the parking-lot 2026-05-30 entry\n(native-speaker review of pt-BR + es-419): non-technical reviewers get\nper-locale markdown sheets instead of the JSON trackers.\n\n- packages/i18n-catalogs/review/{pt-BR,es-419}.review.md: generated\n  sheets — English original + draft translation + Status per entry,\n  instructions at the top, grouped by app surface (methodology\n  vocabulary first, with the philosophical-precision note). 889 entries\n  each: every en-US leaf key not yet signed off (the full catalog, not\n  just the trackers'' drifted `pending` lists — 294 shipped keys were\n  never appended) plus the 26 walkthrough overlay texts the trackers\n  don''t cover.\n- scripts/export-review-md.ts / import-review-md.ts: thin IO wrappers;\n  reviewers edit the sheets (PR), import applies OK entries (wording\n  fixes -> catalogs / walkthrough overlays, sign-offs -> tracker\n  `signed_off` with reviewer + date, pruned from `pending`), prints\n  FLAG entries for follow-up, skips entries whose English drifted.\n  Validation is all-or-nothing per sheet: unknown keys, double\n  sign-offs, emptied translations, ICU placeholder mismatches, and a\n  missing reviewer name abort unapplied.\n- src/review-md.ts + review-sync.ts: the pure render/parse and\n  build/apply halves, unit-tested (40 cases) per ADR 0022 — the whole\n  build -> render -> reviewer-edit -> parse -> apply -> rebuild cycle\n  is pinned without touching the filesystem.\n- make sync-reviews: import then re-export, so signed-off entries drop\n  out of the sheets.\n- tracker `_comment`s + parking-lot triage note updated to record the\n  workflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e0d28bb990e5b9f2a07d50e6bb9f06a1ed8f862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/trees/0e0d28bb990e5b9f2a07d50e6bb9f06a1ed8f862"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruoso/a-conversa/git/commits/b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso","id":81195,"login":"ruoso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruoso","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ruoso/a-conversa/commit/b610192b0955bc8decf77efdb60eeca5db811ee5","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCY7doAKGI2MTAxOTJiMDk1NWJjOGRlY2Y3N2VmZGI2MGVlY2E1ZGI4MT