4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/8c8718fc6c9241773f247b9dc99676d185600a95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T06:24:56Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T06:24:56Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"message":"fix(ui): color score bars by value so they read as a verdict\n\nScore bars used a fixed green->blue->yellow->red gradient filled to\nthe score%, which meant a low score showed green and only a high score\nreached red. Color carried no good/bad meaning and red landed on high\nscores, backwards.\n\nNow each fill is colored by its value bucket: red below 40, amber 40 to\n69, green at 70 and up. Width still equals score%, so a low score is a\nshort red bar and a high score is a long green bar. Applied to the 10\nper-repo dimension bars, the overall RepoRadar score bar, and the repo\ncard match-score bar.\n\nThe \"Slide to tune\" slider rails keep the gradient on purpose: they\nencode the user''s weighting, not a quality judgment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba4b076d8735b4bdc0a12c3a03d279d99c6f9e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/tree