","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RepoRadar/reporadar/commit/480681800dd04fa63f9b8ddd9d4aca32191c1846","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCnSdoAKDQ4MDY4MTgwMGRkMDRmYTYzZjliOGRkZDlkNGFjYTMyMTkxYzE4NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RepoRadar/reporadar/commit/a2b0900483da8326eca8d944b9029aadf9501e01","sha":"a2b0900483da8326eca8d944b9029aadf9501e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/a2b0900483da8326eca8d944b9029aadf9501e01"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/RepoRadar/reporadar/commit/680a902557b1f746a26cf77757c5a112398b3104","sha":"680a902557b1f746a26cf77757c5a112398b3104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/680a902557b1f746a26cf77757c5a112398b3104"}],"sha":"480681800dd04fa63f9b8ddd9d4aca32191c1846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/480681800dd04fa63f9b8ddd9d4aca32191c1846"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254197028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/680a902557b1f746a26cf77757c5a112398b3104/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:47:07Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:47:07Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"message":"perf(trending): shared KV cache so cold isolates skip the GitHub fetch\n\nThe trending-repo cache was a per-isolate in-memory Map. Cloudflare spins up\nmany short-lived isolates, so a cold isolate re-hit the GitHub Search API on\nthe SSR first paint (the slow loads). Add a shared L2 in Cloudflare KV behind\nthe in-memory L1, with stale-while-revalidate:\n  L1 fresh -> serve; KV fresh -> serve (+ warm L1); KV stale -> serve stale +\n  background refresh (ctx.waitUntil); expired/miss -> coalesced GitHub fetch\n  that writes both L1 and KV. ~5 min fresh, 30 min stale/KV-TTL.\n\nKV access is lazy + guarded (getCloudflareContext), so it falls back to the\nold in-memory-only behavior outside a Worker (tests, cron) and on any KV error,\nno regression risk. Homepage SSR now calls fetchTrendingCached so it benefits\ntoo; /api/repos already used it. New TRENDING_CACHE KV binding in wrangler.jsonc\n+ cloudflare-env.d.ts. 8 unit tests for the pure classifyCache/keyOf logic.\n\nNot building AI Gateway response caching (owner''s idea): orthogonal to this\nGitHub-fetch slowness, and the per-repo chat prompt lowers its hit rate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d20cc0e3b5e1dc6ff07f20c7a822b3fb422d4e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/trees/d20cc0e3b5e1dc6ff07f20c7a822b3fb422d4e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/commits/680a902557b1f746a26cf77757c5a112398b3104","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254197028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u