it":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:26:50Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:26:50Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"message":"chore(gstack): team mode + QA gate before every feature push\n\nInstall gstack (Garry Tan''s Claude Code skill suite) and make browser QA a\nhard gate. Team mode (optional/nudge flavor) bootstraps the repo so every\nClaude Code session, teammates and Hermes agents, auto-installs and updates\ngstack; CLAUDE.md now documents the install + \"use /browse for all web\nbrowsing\".\n\nAGENTS.md adds the rule: before pushing any feature (UI, route, or behavior),\nrun gstack /qa and /browse and fix what they find, on top of lint/build/tests.\nPure copy/docs edits are exempt. Also lists the installed gstack skills and\nsays to prefer /browse + /qa over mcp__claude-in-chrome__* tools.\n\nDocs/instructions only, no app code, nothing to deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8e1b03920fb6cab94c499a04b55d19021dc8f61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/trees/e8e1b03920fb6cab94c499a04b55d19021dc8f61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/commits/19618b412f40b5eb6e0a0eb4bd6075215c2f816f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254197028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u