028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/5dc50b1b1e042a7e9648778d10fda0be8ecd3b74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:06:44Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:06:44Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"message":"feat(04-02): implement streaming /api/repo-chat with Gemini hybrid tool loop\n\n- POST /api/repo-chat: runtime=\"nodejs\", streams text/plain token by token\n- All validation (503/400/429/502) returns NextResponse.json BEFORE ReadableStream opens\n- Hybrid tool loop: buffer round, discard pre-tool text, enqueue final text once\n- role:\"function\" for tool responses (correct for @google/generative-ai 0.24.1)\n- MAX_TOOL_ROUNDS=3, MAX_TURNS=10, MAX_CONTENT_CHARS=2000\n- toolExecutor: search_reporadar via fetchTrending+scoreRepo, get_repo_file via Octokit\n- INTL-04: no message bodies, system prompt, or tool args in any console.* call\n- em-dash backstop via stripEmDashes on buffered round text before enqueue\n- No D1/KV writes anywhere; no external logging fetch calls","tree":{"sha":"23c21bfe32e