/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/commits/98926558ec481241b062c9d569a61b75add1bfb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T07:56:56Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T07:56:56Z","email":"ai4ses@gmail.com","name":"Christo Roberts"},"message":"feat(alerts): name the specific alert in verify email + confirmation page\n\nThe double opt-in email and the post-verify page were generic (\"Confirm\nyour alert\" / \"Subscription confirmed\"), so a subscriber couldn''t tell\nwhich alert they were actually confirming. Now both surfaces spell out\nthe exact alert (target tag/search + metric, threshold, and window) in a\nhighlighted box, with a link to the matching repos on the dashboard.\n\n- notifications.ts: add describeAlert() (plain-text summary, no em dashes)\n  and repoFilterUrl() (?topic= for tags, ?q= for searches). buildVerifyEmail\n  now takes the alert fields + origin and renders the summary box + filter\n  link. New buildVerifyConfirmedPage() composes the confirmation page.\n- subscribe/route.ts: pass kind/term/metric/threshold/window_days + origin\n  into buildVerifyEmail (all already in scope at the send call).\n- verify/route.ts: look up the subscription by verify token, set verified_at\n  (idempotent), and render the named confirmation page. Invalid/empty tokens\n  still show the generic expired page; both return 200 (T-03-08, no oracle).\n- tests: new required fields threaded through buildVerifyEmail call sites;\n  added coverage for describeAlert phrasing (all 3 metrics + no-em-dash),\n  repoFilterUrl encoding, the summary/link in the email, and term escaping.\n\nVerified: 47 unit tests pass (incl. local-D1 double opt-in), tsc clean,\nand both rendered surfaces eyeballed in the browser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac2474b09c7b3860b4a4ec0fbda992fc20e82e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/trees/ac2474b09c7b3860b4a4ec0fbda992fc20e82e37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/commits/98926558ec481241b062c9d569a61b75add1bfb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254197028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},