adar\"\nwordmark, so the smaller italic text floated above the wordmark\nbaseline and read as misaligned with the logo. Group the wordmark\nand tagline in a baseline-aligned flex container while the radar\nmark stays centered against the group.\n\nAlso update the tagline copy to \"Stop scrolling and start building!\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd6dffdceda82df09d50ba6f55f850879c4dcb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/trees/fd6dffdceda82df09d50ba6f55f850879c4dcb27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RepoRadar/reporadar/git/commits/674a2f6f79299c9182d905908c15ff4b73318d4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254197028?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ai4ses","id":254197028,"login":"ai4ses","node_id":"U_kgDODya9JA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ai4ses","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RepoRadar/reporadar/commit/674a2f6f79299c9182d905908c15ff4b73318d4d","node_id":"C_kwDOSZCnSdoAKDY3NGEyZjZmNzkyOTljOTE4MmQ5MDU5MDhjMTVmZjRiNzMzMThkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RepoRadar/reporadar/commit/68f4b4388220d6b05623dd279aae5c84f8cdc8ea","sha":"68f4b4388