ps://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/6caa0d90506b5dce23d452159f2bbe13ea469b58","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDZjYWEwZDkwNTA2YjVkY2UyM2Q0NTIxNTlmMmJiZTEzZWE0NjliNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507","sha":"156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507"}],"sha":"6caa0d90506b5dce23d452159f2bbe13ea469b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/6caa0d90506b5dce23d452159f2bbe13ea469b58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:14:13Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:14:13Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(shell): lift the sidebar and the top bar off the page\n\nBoth were flat against the content with only a hairline border between them.\nThey each cast a shadow now, so the chrome reads as sitting in front of the\npage that scrolls past it.\n\nThey needed their own tokens rather than the existing ramp. Every shadow in\n`--shadow-xs`…`--shadow-2xl` casts DOWNWARD, which is right for a card lying\non the page and useless for a full-height sidebar — the shadow falls off the\nbottom of the screen and nothing lands beside it. `--shadow-rail` casts\nsideways for the sidebar; `--shadow-bar` casts down for the top bar. Both are\ndeliberately shallow: these surfaces are permanent, and a shadow you look at\nall day should register as depth rather than as a drop.\n\nBoth are defined for light and dark, and both are applied as\n`shadow-(--shadow-rail)` rather than as the `shadow-rail` utility that\n`@theme` generates. That is not a style preference — see below.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b6602e2140883e9b41d081f372b9b93f95f93db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/0b6602e2140883e9b41d081f372b9b93f95f93db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDE1NmFkMWIzNjYwZjNkMjY0MjBiOTdlN2E1YzhlOGI4ZDNiYjk1MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/876f081ec8a30fdc3c1fa3ae4d1ba4868496c82b","sha":"876f081ec8a30fdc3c1fa3ae4d1ba4868496c82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/876f081ec8a30fdc3c1fa3ae4d1ba4868496c82b"}],"sha":"156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/156ad1b3660f3d26420b97e7a5c8e8b8d3bb9507"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/876f081ec8a30fdc3c1fa3ae4d1ba4868496c82b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:44Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:44Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(shell): a sidebar that reads as one column, not fourteen cards\n\nEvery top-level row carried a description under its label. That doubled the\nheight of fourteen rows, which pushed the Workspace section off the bottom of\na 1250px window, and the one description that might have earned its place was\ntruncated anyway — \"Scaffold new servic…\". Rows ranged from 18px to 33px, so\nthe column had no rhythm either.\n\nRows are one line now, 18–20px each, and Workspace is on screen. The\ndescription survives in the collapsed rail''s tooltip and flyout, where the\nlabel is the only thing visible and a few words of context are the whole point.\n\nWith the rows settled, three things that were being drowned out:\n\n  - **The sub-item guide.** Each child row drew its own 3px stub inside its own\n    content box, so a group of eleven was eleven dashes with the padding and\n    the 2px row gap showing between them. It is drawn on the group now — one\n    unbroken line down the whole section, with the amber marker sitting on it\n    for the page you are on rather than interrupting it.\n  - **Section headers.** A hairline ran from each label to the right edge,\n    drawing a line across the column every few rows and competing with the\n    active rail. Space groups them instead, so the one coloured mark in the\n    nav means one thing.\n  - **The bottom edge.** The nav hides its scrollbar, so a column taller than\n    the window ended on a guillotined row with no sign anything followed it.\n    A fade over the last few pixels dissolves rows into the sidebar. It is an\n    overlay, so it changes no layout, and when the nav fits there is nothing\n    under it to fade.\n\nVerified in both themes and collapsed: no descriptions in the expanded rail,\nuniform row heights, and the collapsed tooltip still reads\n\"Notifications & Insights / Operations, insights\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce79475e12cfa57eb7c079941180136a2731e0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/ce79475e12cfa57eb7c079941180136a2731e0d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/876f081ec8a30fdc3c1fa3ae4d1ba4868496c82b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"star