m/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/3f93b5c2125eccee414fb2f3720a5e5f57094b6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:18:43Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:18:43Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(ui): repaint the console in the brand palette\n\nSampled from the brand artwork rather than matched by eye — the wordmark\nruns #3b82f6 into #8b5cf6, the CTA and the word \"open source\" are\n#1d4ed8, headings are #0f1b3d, the page sits on a blue-tinted white and\nthe terminal is #0f172a.\n\nTwo things were off. The brand ramp was a duller, darker blue than the\nartwork''s, and the accent was teal — so `from-brand-500 to-accent-500`,\nwhich the assist surface and the login hero both use, ran blue into\ngreen. That is a gradient the brand does not have anywhere; it is blue\ninto violet, and the accent is now the artwork''s violet. Surfaces and\ntext carry a blue cast in both themes instead of being near-neutral, so\nlight and dark read as one family.\n\nThis lands as tokens, not component edits: everything already draws from\n`--color-brand-*`, `--color-accent-*`, `--color-surface-*` and\n`--color-content-*`, so the whole console moves at once.\n\n`--color-accent-950` is new. The login hero referenced it behind a\nfallback and Tailwind emitted no utility for it, so the one place that\nasked for a deep accent silently got deep brand instead. Every preset now\ndefines it, or picking Emerald would inherit the default theme''s violet.\n\nThe default preset keeps the id `cobalt` so saved workspace themes still\nresolve, and is renamed Adhar with the brand swatches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3091d9895562d1432572031f87875dab2ef2f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/b3091d9895562d1432572031f87875dab2ef2f60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/3f93b5c2125eccee414fb2f3720a5e5f57094b6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/3f93b5c2125eccee414fb2f3720a5e5f57094b6e","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDNmOTNiNWMyMTI1ZWNjZWU0MTRmYjJmMzcyMGE1ZTVmNTcwOTRiNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/223e20f31119b6012b87e1b66c26384c901a7d18","sha":"223e20f31119b6012b87e1b66c26384c901a7d18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/223e20f31119b6012b87e1b66c26384c901a7d18"}],"sha":"3f93b5c2125eccee414fb2f3720a5e5f57094b6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/3f93b5c2125eccee414fb2f3720a5e5f57094b6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/223e20f31119b6012b87e1b66c26384c901a7d18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:18:31Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:18:31Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(ai): drop the insight cards from the landing\n\nThe landing carried two more blocks under the hero: what the platform\noperators had noticed, and your unread notifications, each a card of rows\nwith an \"Ask\" affordance. Both already have a page of their own behind\nthe bell, and both put a wall of findings on the one screen whose whole\njob is to get out of the way of the composer underneath it — the same\nargument that removed the agent roster, the starter prompts and the\nrecents before them.\n\nWith them go `OperatorFindings`, `Card`, `Row` and the `accentDot` and\n`useNotifications` imports that nothing else in the file used, and the\n`onPick` and `findings` props, which the surface was still computing and\nthreading through for a component that no longer reads them.\n\nNothing is lost from the product: operator findings and notifications are\nboth still on the Notifications & Insights page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c3c7bf0a44f8f99fad1c91ce0ffcd57746cdd23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/9c3c7bf0a44f8f99fad1c91ce0ffcd57746cdd23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/223e20f31119b6012b87e1b66c26384c901a7d18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url