ments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:50:34Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:50:34Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"Cloud dev environments fix","tree":{"sha":"f58a1eefcbe62f6fe25d2a334143821cacb26ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/f58a1eefcbe62f6fe25d2a334143821cacb26ce8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/d28a9f017d9a6a5ec7c4d2bcef3aeacc7a668dd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/d28a9f017d9a6a5ec7c4d2bcef3aeacc7a668dd0","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKGQyOGE5ZjAxN2Q5YTZhNWVjN2M0ZDJiY2VmM2FlYWNjN2E2NjhkZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e","sha":"2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e"}],"sha":"d28a9f017d9a6a5ec7c4d2bcef3aeacc7a668dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/d28a9f017d9a6a5ec7c4d2bcef3aeacc7a668dd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:21:55Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:21:55Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(perf): the Scripts list says what happened, and Runs can be acted on\n\nScripts was a column of bare filenames. Which of a dozen tests last failed,\nand which had never run at all, were both invisible until you clicked through\nthem one at a time. Each row now carries its newest run — stage, a dot\ncoloured by outcome, how long ago, and a link straight into that run — or\nsays \"never run\", which is itself the answer to a question people ask. The\nruns are matched by the label the console already stamps on every run it\ncreates, so this is a join over data that was on the cluster all along. A\nfind box appears once there are more than five tests.\n\nRuns gained the column that was missing from a list of runs: which test each\none came from, with the commit it ran. The name alone is a timestamp, and\nreading the script ConfigMap to work out the rest was the only way.\n\nRow actions land on the row: Pause or Resume while a run is in flight, Run\nagain once it is not, and Delete. Acting on a run previously meant opening\nthe drawer first, which is two clicks and a panel to do the commonest thing\nin the list. They are shown only to someone who may write, and a refusal\nsurfaces with the reason the apiserver gave.","tree":{"sha":"eaa89307fc8763f59e53f5cf79ad36fa8aa40c16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/eaa89307fc8763f59e53f5cf79ad36fa8aa40c16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDJkYzljNzgxNjdlYTFkOGMwNjI5OGQzNTFkNjAzYjJhMzVlMjBhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d","sha":"98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d"}],"sha":"2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/2dc9c78167ea1d8c06298d351d603b2a35e20a8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:15:11Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:15:11Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"fix(mobile): controls you can actually hit with a thumb\n\nMeasured on a 390px phone against the live catalog: every button and link on\nthe catalog page and in the entity drawer, checked for size, horizontal\noverflow and clipped text.\n\nThe sidebar was the worst of it. Below `lg` that column is the mobile sheet,\nwhere a row is a touch target rather than a pointer target — and a sub-item\nlike \"Issues\" under Define was an 18px line of text. Rows now carry a 44px\nminimum there, and the LINK stretches to fill the row: giving the row height\nalone left the tap landing on nothing above and below the text, which is the\nsame miss with more space around it. The desktop rail keeps its density from\n`lg` up, where there is a cursor to aim with.\n\nThen the controls that sit in card footers and section headers: a card''s\nMonitor and Source links at 23px, the drawer header''s Copy at 27px, and ten\nsection links (\"Scorecard →\", \"Metrics →\", \"CI / CD runs →\", \"All alerts →\"\nand the rest) at 16 to 18px. All of them get a comfortable minimum on a\nphone and their previous density from `sm` up.\n\nLinks inside prose are deliberately left alone — padding a word in the middle\nof a sentence to 44px breaks the sentence.\n\nThe catalog page now measures clean at 390px: nothing overflows, nothing is\nclipped, and no control is under-sized.","tree":{"sha":"0d91b8e00c38ac4272ec00612bebc85dd1ffc5b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/0d91b8e00c38ac4272ec00612bebc85dd1ffc5b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDk4ZDA4OWE0M2RlMzFlOGZmYzBmMDU0OTMyMmJmZmQ1N2UzNDYxNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0","sha":"750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0"}],"sha":"98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/98d089a43de31e8ffc0f0549322bffd57e34615d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:04:31Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:04:31Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(apps): Strapi in the launcher, and no tiles onto things you cannot open\n\nEvery tool the BFF knows reports `configured: true`, because its URL is\nDERIVED from the base domain rather than observed. The launcher trusted that\nand drew a tile for anything with a name, so it offered doors onto services\nthat answer \"authentication failure: no bearer token\" or a bare 404 to a\nbrowser. Clicking one cost a sign-in round trip and landed on nothing.\n\nChecked against the cluster''s own Gateway routes and by asking each host what\nit serves:\n\n  • Strapi added, with the official mark from the project''s artwork.\n  • Loki and Tempo now open Grafana Explore on their datasource, which is\n    what their UI actually is — the routes in front of them serve an API.\n    Mimir''s tile is gone: the Prometheus tile already lists it as a backing\n    tool, so it was the same door twice.\n  • Faro removed — its host 404s, because Faro is a browser SDK and a\n    collector, not a page.\n  • lakeFS removed — no route on the platform at all.\n  • Dynamically-discovered tools must now appear in the cluster''s routed\n    hostnames to become a tile, which drops the ones whose URL was a guess.\n  • A curated entry''s `sub` counts as covered, so OpenBao stopped rendering\n    twice: once as its real tile and once as a generic discovered one.\n  • APIs and control-plane components that have never had a UI (the AI and\n    MCP endpoints, the OTel collector, Kyverno, Trivy, Falco, Crossplane)\n    are excluded by name, with the reason written down.\n\nDiscovered tiles now say they were found from a route on this cluster rather\nthan calling themselves a platform service.","tree":{"sha":"202de1167cd779dd4930934b7c8d0f1098a750ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/202de1167cd779dd4930934b7c8d0f1098a750ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDc1MDYyOWYyNjFkZTVkNmVmZjhlMmM2NTgyMTVlYmUxNWU0MDBkYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52","sha":"62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52"}],"sha":"750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/750629f261de5d6eff8e2c658215ebe15e400db0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:52:57Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:52:57Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(perf): a run drawer you can watch, and runs that actually start\n\nTwo things were wrong with the Performance Center''s run detail.\n\nRuns never started. The k6 CRD types `paused` as a string and DEFAULTS it to\n\"true\", so a TestRun created without the field sits in `initialization`\nforever. \"Run test\" created exactly such a run: no error, no progress, no\nexplanation. Both creation paths now state `paused: \"false\"` explicitly, and\n\"Run again\" unpauses rather than faithfully reproducing a pause.\n\nThe drawer opened on Summary, which is empty until k6 prints its end-of-test\nsummary — so a twenty-minute run showed nothing for twenty minutes. It now\nopens on a Live tab:\n\n  • Stages as a CI pipeline reads them — a node per stage with its real\n    duration from the operator''s condition transitions, its state, and a\n    click to see what that stage means and what the operator recorded for\n    it. The old view was a row of pills that said only which stage was\n    current.\n  • Concurrency and throughput charted from k6''s own progress lines, which\n    it prints about once a second. There are no `k6_*` series in Prometheus\n    on this platform, so stdout is the only live signal there is; parsing it\n    is exact rather than approximate, because those are k6''s counters.\n  • Latency percentiles are deliberately not plotted. k6 computes them once,\n    at the end, so there is no honest p95-over-time to draw, and the panel\n    says so instead of drawing a line from numbers that do not exist.\n\nThe parser is pure and covered: ramping and steady VU formats, carriage-return\nredraws, ANSI colour, a restarted runner that must not produce a negative\nrate, and output with no progress lines at all — which yields nothing rather\nthan zeroes.\n\nThe drawer is also a sheet on a phone, with a tab row that fades where it\nscrolls.","tree":{"sha":"68892911e5dc324c50d9a51289e67fb5ebb9f5fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/68892911e5dc324c50d9a51289e67fb5ebb9f5fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDYyZjkzZmRiYzFiNTEyNzM2ZGRkMjk0OTAzMDlmZDVjYTdiN2JkNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f","sha":"323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f"}],"sha":"62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/62f93fdbc1b512736ddd29490309fd5ca7b7bd52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:37:16Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:37:16Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(ai): the landing reads on a phone, and the composer stops claiming context it never sent\n\nThe composer listed \"page\", \"cluster\" and \"namespace\" beside the Context\ntoggle, which read as three facts travelling with every question. None of\nthem did: the context the store attaches is the focused resource and nothing\nelse. The chips are gone and the toggle''s tooltip now says what it actually\ndoes; the resource chip stays, because that one is real.\n\nThe landing was a desktop page shown at phone width. It was centred with an\nauto margin, so on a screen shorter than the content the hero sat above the\nscrollable area behind half a screen of blank space — the page opened on\nnothing. Centring is now `safe center`, which centres while there is room and\nfalls back to the top edge once there is not, and only for the welcome: a\ntranscript reads from the top.\n\nBelow that the order was wrong for a phone. Eight full-width agent cards came\nfirst, a screen and a half to scroll past before reaching the prompts, which\nare what a person came to tap. The prompts now come first and the roster\nfollows as a two-across picker — name, accent, tool count — with the\ndescriptions that make it a reading exercise waiting for a wider screen. The\nhero''s mark, heading and padding step down too.","tree":{"sha":"fef4be3c35a0a4397484dbffbe455944907b1da1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/fef4be3c35a0a4397484dbffbe455944907b1da1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/323aaf0785fe4d83ac36df9e6540a3fba1151d1f","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDMyM2FhZjA3ODVmZTRkODNhYzM2ZGY5ZTY1NDBhM2ZiYTExNTFkMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/c6a0feed08929cf0f5f7a0bd1f7de630ff1046aa","sha":"c6a0feed08929cf0f5f7a0bd1f7de630ff1046aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/comm