gin":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/4feaffc07976dee198ffb9f5a3cfc16771394504/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:06:23Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:06:23Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(ai): new Adhar AI mark and a cleaner landing\n\nThe mark was the console''s hexagon with an orbit around it — at 16px the\norbit closed into a ring and it read as the product logo with noise on it.\nIt is now a rounded tile in the same brand ramp carrying a four-point spark,\nthe shape people already read as \"AI\", with a smaller spark high right to\ngive it direction. It stays legible from a favicon to the 64px hero.\n\nThe landing led with a three-step explainer and a 2x2 grid of runtime\ncounters — more to read than the agents underneath, which is the wrong way\nround on an empty page. The hero is now the mark, one sentence, and one line\nof live facts: runtime state, MCP servers, tools, how grounding is retrieved\nand what a write becomes. Everything that was decoration is gone; the roster,\nthe prompt cards and the recent conversations are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"34e9ae458a19e30649c110d8742814bb7d6c8e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/34e9ae458a19e30649c110d8742814bb7d6c8e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/4feaffc07976dee198ffb9f5a3cfc16771394504","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/4feaffc07976dee198ffb9f5a3cfc16771394504","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKDRmZWFmZmMwNzk3NmRlZTE5OGZmYjlmNWEzY2ZjMTY3NzEzOTQ1MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b","sha":"d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b"}],"sha":"4feaffc07976dee198ffb9f5a3cfc16771394504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/4feaffc07976dee198ffb9f5a3cfc16771394504"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:06:22Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:06:22Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"feat(develop): rebuild Repositories as a real browser\n\nThe screen had a search box, four selects and two layouts, and the table''s\naction column put four buttons on every row, which overflowed the viewport\nand pushed Updated off screen.\n\nIt is now a browser. Search sits in a toolbar card with a / shortcut; a\nFilters popover holds visibility, state, language, topic and activity\n(has open issues, has open PRs, updated this week, quiet for 90+ days); a\nSort menu carries seven keys and a direction, and the table''s own column\nheaders sort too. Every active filter shows as a removable chip above the\nlist with a count, so the state of the list is always readable. A third\ncompact layout joins grid and table. Layout, sort and direction persist.\n\nRow actions collapse into one ⋯ menu shared by all three layouts, and the\nwhole row opens the drawer. Grid cards reserve their description and topic\nrows so the stats line up across a row.","tree":{"sha":"0b9a04b65c83f57d0346c0f7b3a15d73eedf93b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/0b9a04b65c83f57d0346c0f7b3a15d73eedf93b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKGQ0NjZmMjY3NjlhOTUzNjBlZWExY2Y5ZjRmZGIwMTgyN2ZhZDQ5OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5","sha":"c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5"}],"sha":"d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/d466f26769a95360eea1cf9f4fdb01827fad498b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:05:59Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:05:59Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"fix(ui): popovers close when you click outside them\n\nThe app launcher and the organization switcher stayed open when the click\nlanded on the sidebar, the topbar or a drawer. Both relied on a transparent\nfull-screen backdrop behind the panel to catch outside clicks, which only\nworks while nothing on the page sits above that backdrop — and the shell''s\nown chrome does.\n\nA new useClickOutside hook listens on the document instead and asks whether\nthe event was inside the panel, so no backdrop and no z-index arithmetic are\nneeded, and the outside click still does its own job (clicking a nav link\ncloses the menu and navigates). It listens on pointerdown so the panel is\ngone before the outside element handles its click, and it handles Escape,\nwhich every popover wanted anyway. Portalled dialogs opened from a menu are\ntreated as inside.\n\nThe same backdrop pattern remains in six module menus where it is harmless;\ntheir backdrop and panel move above the topbar and sidebar layers so a click\nanywhere now reaches them.","tree":{"sha":"e0518322edad8859a0f6eb0079925da522c27006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/e0518322edad8859a0f6eb0079925da522c27006"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5","node_id":"C_kwDOSZcuM9oAKGM0ZDFkYzc4YjgxZjBkYzNmZWYwYWFjMzU3MzVkOTI2NWQwMDI1YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adhar-io/adhar-console/commit/69dc146363ac9c6ae6fada6d6e90420a7a243d9f","sha":"69dc146363ac9c6ae6fada6d6e90420a7a243d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/69dc146363ac9c6ae6fada6d6e90420a7a243d9f"}],"sha":"c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/c4d1dc78b81f0dc3fef0aac35735d9265d0025a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/commits/69dc146363ac9c6ae6fada6d6e90420a7a243d9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:05:43Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:05:43Z","email":"tapas.friends@gmail.com","name":"Tapas Jena"},"message":"fix(dev): local development reaches the live cluster''s update stream\n\nThree things kept a laptop off the realtime hub, each hiding the next.\n\nThe origin guard compared the page''s origin with this server''s own host. In\ndev the browser talks to the Vite host on :5100 which proxies to the BFF on\nanother loopback port, so the two never matched and every WebSocket upgrade\nwas refused. It now also accepts an upgrade when both sides are loopback and\nthe process is not running in-cluster — the laptop case, unreachable from\nanother machine. Production stays strict.\n\nThe live handler read the request''s cookie and URL AFTER calling\nupgradeWebSocket, which throws \"Request closed\" and leaves the upgrade\nunanswered. That code was never reached before because auth rejected first.\nBoth reads now happen before the upgrade.\n\nThe demo session lives in the browser only, so the BFF sees no cookie. When\nthe gateway has already granted the local-dev identity (ADHAR_DEV_CLUSTER_AUTH,\nlaptop only), the live hub answers under it instead of 401ing.\n\nTogether the console goes from a permanent \"Reconnecting\" pill with silent\npolling to \"Live — updates arrive as they happen\".","tree":{"sha":"a3be2741eda15e46ec7826d030481841452c1ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/trees/a3be2741eda15e46ec7826d030481841452c1ca1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adhar-io/adhar-console/git/commits/69dc146363ac9c6ae6fada6d6e90420a7a243d9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapas4java","id":2254963,"login":"tapas4java","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQ5NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapas4java/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use